st native ONNX session memory growth and engine cleanup after initialization failure. r=ai-platform-reviewers,nordzilla\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334321\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/ml/tests/browser/browser.toml", "toolkit/components/ml/tests/browser/browser_ml_engine_initialization_failure.js", "toolkit/components/ml/tests/browser/browser_ml_inference_session_memory.js", "toolkit/components/ml/tests/browser/ml_engine_initialization_failure.worker.mjs", "toolkit/components/ml/tests/browser/ml_inference_session_memory.worker.mjs"], "git_node": "1d9bc9ed888d69eed878809f3b184544b976bfcd", "git_parents": ["7fd4eb39d98c6245d8eb141f044c43897ed4172f"], "node": "385dfa9e0682a155cea9919c860a05f6f041f420", "parents": ["465adcc82999ce6dde66d8a4269e48b3be5b706c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Valentin Pollet \u003cvpollet@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074072 - Release native ONNX inference outputs and metadata. Release engines and workers after initialization failure. r=ai-platform-reviewers,nordzilla\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334322\n", "files": ["dom/onnx/InferenceSession.cpp", "toolkit/components/ml/actors/MLEngineChild.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/ml/actors/MLEngineParent.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "ca6b1d03bd469538c88d7b42913ea0b2a21987b7", "git_parents": ["1d9bc9ed888d69eed878809f3b184544b976bfcd"], "node": "81ab3f52374664c20560b90c018569c927ad87e2", "parents": ["385dfa9e0682a155cea9919c860a05f6f041f420"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alexandru Marc \u003camarc@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2084870 - Upgrade 7-zip to 26.05. r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,ahochheiden\" for causing 7zz bustage\n\nThis reverts commit 8c18222015065a47be11eafc27ee8aadb42fd9b3.\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/fetch/toolchains.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/toolchain/7zz.yml", "taskcluster/scripts/misc/7zz.patch", "taskcluster/scripts/misc/build-7zz.sh"], "git_node": "4f9ade73c7e124ba526e4a989d127b581fe923c0", "git_parents": ["ca6b1d03bd469538c88d7b42913ea0b2a21987b7"], "node": "d5d0ec9c9f3e863d1e7d42feff3b2ff28867b9cc", "parents": ["81ab3f52374664c20560b90c018569c927ad87e2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tim Giles \u003ctgiles@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081926 - Add recomp-frontend-review skill. r=ai4dev-reviewers,padenot,mkennedy\n\nAdd shared component and design system checks for automated and standalone\nreviews. Load the skill and runsheet through review-context.toml for\nwidget and design system patches.\n\nKeep shared scope and evidence requirements in the skill overview, with\nthe standalone acquisition, delegation, and reporting procedure in a\nseparate reference. Automated reviews use the supplied patch, available\nsource tools, and host response format without requiring a local checkout\nor subagents.\n\nRequire consumer inspection when compatibility or a claimed consequence\nneeds it. Allow an explained omission when the complete change preserves\nthe relevant contract. Keep missing evidence and unverified conclusions\nin follow-up rather than issuing an unqualified clean verdict.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334759\n", "files": [".agents/skills/recomp-frontend-review/SKILL.md", ".agents/skills/recomp-frontend-review/references/runsheet.md", ".agents/skills/recomp-frontend-review/references/standalone-workflow.md", ".claude/skills/recomp-frontend-review/SKILL.md", ".claude/skills/recomp-frontend-review/references/runsheet.md", ".claude/skills/recomp-frontend-review/references/standalone-workflow.md", "review-context.toml"], "git_node": "06e311b673e1596b5fbde4dba54e703399ce1a73", "git_parents": ["4f9ade73c7e124ba526e4a989d127b581fe923c0"], "node": "0d50f90de1a1f0580c8719477261581fed603766", "parents": ["d5d0ec9c9f3e863d1e7d42feff3b2ff28867b9cc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Moyin \u003cmadeyemi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084914 - Stop playback after exiting readermode on the playing tab r=android-reviewers,matt-tighe\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336216\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/listentopage/ListenAction.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/listentopage/ListenMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/listentopage/ListenMiddlewareTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/metrics.yaml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/listentopage/ListenToPageTelemetryMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/listentopage/ListenToPageTelemetryMiddlewareTest.kt"], "git_node": "006217c78481a5d1878d47145ece8a723da2e9e6", "git_parents": ["06e311b673e1596b5fbde4dba54e703399ce1a73"], "node": "4292627ca6f9fa02466b248c611ea9691bc8896c", "parents": ["0d50f90de1a1f0580c8719477261581fed603766"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dre Grant \u003cdgrant@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083874 - Horoscope: Add the context menu r=fchasen\n\nThe Horoscopes menu needs a Powered by Yahoo link at the top. This adds `WidgetMenuPoweredBy`, a shared menu item that opens the partner site in a new tab and records the click under the widget's own action name.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336073\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Widgets/Horoscopes/Horoscopes.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Widgets/WidgetMenuPoweredBy.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/Widgets/Horoscopes.test.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/Widgets/WidgetMenuPoweredBy.test.jsx"], "git_node": "15c49a6dac52ab8734e3a99d8937a86b1272dc78", "git_parents": ["006217c78481a5d1878d47145ece8a723da2e9e6"], "node": "abbaf8c391ad02175545173e9c41feb64e974d3c", "parents": ["4292627ca6f9fa02466b248c611ea9691bc8896c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2085011 - Update AndroidX DataStore to version 1.3.0. r=android-reviewers,android-build-system-reviewers,ahochheiden,adhingra\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336184\n", "files": ["gradle/libs.versions.toml"], "git_node": "df00cbf51ab00159131938e73cb54580b1edd252", "git_parents": ["15c49a6dac52ab8734e3a99d8937a86b1272dc78"], "node": "4a20712fac4e07f91c337d944e52428e1f183baa", "parents": ["abbaf8c391ad02175545173e9c41feb64e974d3c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2085011 - Update AndroidX Paging to version 3.5.3. r=android-reviewers,android-build-system-reviewers,ahochheiden,adhingra\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336185\n", "files": ["gradle/libs.versions.toml"], "git_node": "3c16758421339308cb5bc8361ac9dfc1d918a8c1", "git_parents": ["df00cbf51ab00159131938e73cb54580b1edd252"], "node": "110d8e900309280d0180d678e61da95936ebc9dd", "parents": ["4a20712fac4e07f91c337d944e52428e1f183baa"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2085011 - Update AndroidX Palette to version 1.1.0. r=android-reviewers,android-build-system-reviewers,ahochheiden,adhingra\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336186\n", "files": ["gradle/libs.versions.toml"], "git_node": "12fa4ab5d3d237677ec4704af47e50170bac459f", "git_parents": ["3c16758421339308cb5bc8361ac9dfc1d918a8c1"], "node": "45399852090d3734c684dd167b3983c2f74eb28b", "parents": ["110d8e900309280d0180d678e61da95936ebc9dd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Han Yue \u003calexyuehan@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083187 - Don't throw when a session file has no savedGroups in SessionStartup's pinned-tab count. r=sfoster,sessionstore-reviewers\n\nSession files written by Firefox 132 and earlier have no savedGroups\nproperty, so the idle callback that counts pinned tabs threw a TypeError\nbefore recording browser.engagement.max_concurrent_tab_pinned_count.\nGuard the saved-groups count and add an xpcshell test that starts from a\nlegacy session file with one pinned tab.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335030\n", "files": ["browser/components/sessionstore/SessionStartup.sys.mjs", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/unit/test_startup_pinned_tabs_no_savedgroups.js", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/unit/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "c888b760172b00134e1ea08ce9f2910624d2218e", "git_parents": ["12fa4ab5d3d237677ec4704af47e50170bac459f"], "node": "fb2d89f4252fe8fe200e3240eb5d9635c3625d3b", "parents": ["45399852090d3734c684dd167b3983c2f74eb28b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rebecca King \u003crking@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084722 - Hide 'Your Rule' section when the VPN is not connected - r=ip-protection-reviewers,sstreich,mcleinman\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336162\n", "files": ["browser/components/ipprotection/IPProtectionPanel.sys.mjs", "browser/components/ipprotection/IPProtectionToolbarButton.sys.mjs", "browser/components/ipprotection/content/ipprotection-content.mjs", "browser/components/ipprotection/tests/browser/browser_ipprotection_content_site_rules.js", "browser/components/ipprotection/tests/xpcshell/test_IPProtectionToolbarButton.js"], "git_node": "e3d574c28dee00d1e586e1dc14d1af771fa371b6", "git_parents": ["c888b760172b00134e1ea08ce9f2910624d2218e"], "node": "6e7c4f85471837d9540b363ddb07704323e4a98f", "parents": ["fb2d89f4252fe8fe200e3240eb5d9635c3625d3b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Keith Cirkel \u003ckeithamus@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2031723 - Add shortcut for copying current tab URL r=fluent-reviewers,bolsson\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336260\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/browser-sets.inc.xhtml", "browser/base/content/browser-sets.js", "browser/components/customkeys/CustomKeysParent.sys.mjs", "browser/components/customkeys/tests/browser/browser_CustomKeys.js", "browser/components/customkeys/tests/browser/browser_aboutKeyboard.js", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/customkeys.ftl"], "git_node": "e940b2854950365466fca51c88e38bd27c88ec32", "git_parents": ["e3d574c28dee00d1e586e1dc14d1af771fa371b6"], "node": "2ed7f5fc3aa04809caca042693d513be3f2d6cbe", "parents": ["6e7c4f85471837d9540b363ddb07704323e4a98f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Hochheiden \u003cahochheiden@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2038789 - Move the Objective-C compile flags from `config.mk` to `ComputedFlags` r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,sergesanspaille\n\nThe compile database read the same `VariablePassthru` directly, so it reads the\ncomputed values now.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328998\n", "files": ["config/config.mk", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/compilation/database.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/frontend/context.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/frontend/emitter.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/backend/common.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/backend/data/database-objc/baz.m", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/backend/data/database-objc/build/non-unified-compat", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/backend/data/database-objc/moz.build", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/backend/data/database-objc/qux.mm", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/backend/test_database.py"], "git_node": "c5f3845df84eccdd4f3b286e3f1be7c548402dcd", "git_parents": ["e940b2854950365466fca51c88e38bd27c88ec32"], "node": "e4e83c837f4ac34b91a319696287ba8e5a4d9dde", "parents": ["2ed7f5fc3aa04809caca042693d513be3f2d6cbe"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Hochheiden \u003cahochheiden@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2038789 - Move the Windows stack size flag from `config.mk` to `ComputedFlags` r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,sergesanspaille\n\nHost programs no longer get it. The reserve is sized for Gecko layout recursion\non deeply nested DOM (bug 256180, bug 582910), and its value comes from the\ntarget CPU. Neither fits a build tool. Nothing depended on it either, since host\nprograms never got it on mingw or on any non Windows host.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329003\n", "files": ["config/config.mk", "config/rules.mk", "js/xpconnect/src/XPCJSContext.cpp", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/frontend/context.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/frontend/test_emitter.py"], "git_node": "557d696040f11d6875e3e90c233b4f7919c52d57", "git_parents": ["c5f3845df84eccdd4f3b286e3f1be7c548402dcd"], "node": "8d60c49f9bc68adf71d44a12ae1c9239617e006f", "parents": ["e4e83c837f4ac34b91a319696287ba8e5a4d9dde"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Hochheiden \u003cahochheiden@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2038789 - Move the macOS program rpath from `rules.mk` to `ComputedFlags` r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,sylvestre\n\nThe `@executable_path/Frameworks` rpath for `arm` `Darwin` targets is removed.\nOnly an `armv7-apple-ios` target gives that pair, and Firefox does not build one.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329004\n", "files": ["config/rules.mk", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/frontend/context.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/frontend/test_emitter.py"], "git_node": "5947465d264d7f7f8a211cfaa7348f399fc80b01", "git_parents": ["557d696040f11d6875e3e90c233b4f7919c52d57"], "node": "1fa08972c3f98b52d0db4d462a8c336e37739eff", "parents": ["8d60c49f9bc68adf71d44a12ae1c9239617e006f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Silaghi \u003casilaghi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 1972602 - Remove 