", "desc": "Bug 2084963 - Annotate a test as passing on nativePrinter since it doesn't support this pref.\n\nSigned-off-by: Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-page/page-orientation-on-portrait-002-print.html.ini"], "git_node": "c72a2e31ceeb7a8004676d0e800628ec65196fa6", "git_parents": ["74b29b2f76ea6920b4bd54275e7c2634156523a2"], "node": "fbb0200072fc18d743fc913809b27ffe668d43f9", "parents": ["33649d150b783fd182a8ee6dbcd59742f1e3b4c1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084964 - Use logical directions for progress/meter orientation in vertical writing-modes. r=jfkthame,layout-reviewers\n\nProposed change in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/13054, matches\nWebKit / Blink.\n\nExtra tests in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/63544\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336149\n", "files": ["layout/forms/nsProgressFrame.cpp", "layout/reftests/forms/meter/meter-orient-vertical-top-ref.html", "layout/reftests/forms/meter/reftest.list", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-writing-modes/forms/meter-appearance-native-vertical-rtl.optional.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-writing-modes/forms/meter-appearance-native-vertical.optional.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-writing-modes/forms/progress-appearance-native-vertical-rtl.optional.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-writing-modes/forms/progress-appearance-native-vertical.optional.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-writing-modes/forms/progress-appearance-none-vertical-rtl.optional.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-writing-modes/forms/progress-appearance-none-vertical.optional.html.ini", "widget/Theme.cpp"], "git_node": "1228284dcc354870cbce476f4f3e77998b7f9cdd", "git_parents": ["c72a2e31ceeb7a8004676d0e800628ec65196fa6"], "node": "3d2fc7ed51fb2b72c9d8497b5255421e98a130ae", "