ristau\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336106\n", "files": ["taskcluster/docker/funsize-update-generator/requirements.txt", "taskcluster/docker/snap-coreXX-build/snap-tests/requirements.txt"], "git_node": "f7756d941e2720dd695048973dccbc516395e8f4", "git_parents": ["efd2d1e6f77570ae6bc5294731a68101e45c81a3"], "node": "02cea595c9d85b8e7f7fd96bce2b381ef6f64d11", "parents": ["19272f1f7a2c1a4bc07452f957d48d0b9a980197"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084865 - Upgrade docker images to pick ca-certificates updates. r=jcristau\n\nWe have to defer Ubuntu 24.04 updates until the side effects of the mesa\non webgl tests are figured out.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336115\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/docker-image/kind.yml"], "git_node": "29913c2aa278d77cf0a99bd7e051e1cc5a41544a", "git_parents": ["f7756d941e2720dd695048973dccbc516395e8f4"], "node": "aca7c02ffd9bd2d426fa5de7aafb396a6b5621b8", "parents": ["02cea595c9d85b8e7f7fd96bce2b381ef6f64d11"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew Osmond \u003caosmond@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076287 - Improve guards against software decoding and encoding for FFmpeg in the GPU process. r=media-playback-reviewers,azebrowski\n\nNote that on Windows, if a hardware encoder fails to initialize in the GPU\nprocess, we no longer fallback to a software encoder in the GPU process, and\ninstead fail to initialize the encoder and fall back to the next PEM.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329661\n", "files": ["dom/media/platforms/ffmpeg/FFmpegDataDecoder.cpp", "dom/media/platforms/ffmpeg/FFmpegDecoderModule.h", "dom/media/platforms/ffmpeg/FFmpegEncoderModule.cpp", "dom/media/platforms/ffmpeg/FFmpegEncoderModule.h", "dom/media/platforms/ffmpeg/FFmpegVideoEncoder.cpp"], "git_node": "5b05d3bb4bd2e2ace00f41273965ae7f5fe6ed20", "git_parents": ["29913c2aa278d77cf0a99bd7e051e1cc5a41544a"], "node": "dc285f5a09d44971f429284b66b5936438b81e68", "parents": ["aca7c02ffd9bd2d426fa5de7aafb396a6b5621b8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Import translations from https://github.com/mozilla-l10n/android-l10n CLOSED TREE\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-bg/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-bqi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-co/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-cs/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-cy/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-da/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-de/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-dsb/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-el/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-en-rCA/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-en-rGB/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-es-rAR/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-es-rCL/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-eu/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-fa/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-fi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-fr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-fy-rNL/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-gl/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-gn/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-hsb/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-hu/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-hy-rAM/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ia/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-in/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-is/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-it/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-iw/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ja/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ka/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-kk/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-kmr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ko/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-lv/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-nb-rNO/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-nl/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-nn-rNO/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-pa-rIN/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-pl/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-pt-rBR/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-pt-rPT/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ro/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ru/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-sk/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-skr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-sq/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-sv-rSE/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-tr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-uk/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-vi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-zh-rCN/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-zh-rTW/strings.xml"], "git_node": "4604e12ae6d1039e8753961c9fd41ce983e2920f", "git_parents": ["5b05d3bb4bd2e2ace00f41273965ae7f5fe6ed20"], "node": "9ecfacaf7e73dd51a74a58e0f7021b5f46c551c2", "parents": ["dc285f5a09d44971f429284b66b5936438b81e68"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew Osmond \u003caosmond@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082552 - Wait for the GPU process to be recreated before creating remote decoders and encoders in it. r=media-playback-reviewers,padenot\n\nWe assumed the GPU process was always ready, so creation could race with\ncrash recovery. Now creation in the GPU process waits for the new endpoint,\nand is rejected if the GPU process, or decoding in it, was disabled so that\ncallers may use another process.\n\nPreviously, creation during crash recovery would fail and fallback to another\nprocess, such as RDD on Windows. Now it waits for the GPU process to be\nrecreated. On Android, the GPU process is only relaunched when the app is in\nthe foreground, so creation waits until then. If the content process is not\ngiven new endpoints when rendering is reinitialized, creation waits until it\nis reinitialized again, as tasks deferred until the GPU process is recreated\nalready did.\n\nTasks deferred until the GPU process is recreated now also run if we were\nnot given a new endpoint, instead of never running.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334286\n", "files": ["dom/media/ipc/RemoteMediaManagerChild.cpp", "dom/media/ipc/RemoteMediaManagerChild.h", "dom/media/ipc/RemoteVideoDecoder.cpp"], "git_node": "42eb30ee5f050691ca86618aec519d6541c75b6e", "git_parents": ["4604e12ae6d1039e8753961c9fd41ce983e2920f"], "node": "d19aedb3419d911abbb98be851fd3c485c4cd99a", "parents": ["9ecfacaf7e73dd51a74a58e0f7021b5f46c551c2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Bumping Firefox l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD CLOSED TREE\n\nach -\u003e 9c16080776b83e994de5afdb0bcddb9afb739aae\naf -\u003e 9c16080776b83e994de5afdb0bcddb9afb739aae\nan -\u003e 9c16080776b83e994de5afdb0bcddb9afb739aae\nar -\u003e 9c16080776b83e994de5afdb0bcddb9afb739aae\nast -\u003e 9c16080776b83e994de5afdb0bcddb9afb73