 -\u003e 54d38871fcc35859259d43c11b54712ba2e2f541\n", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": "64eb50a6f1ea672f603e40f5dcdddbb26fb31f92", "git_parents": ["03a333fd748295b22cf395593c686d5aaeeda952"], "node": "f152e88a1bce09ec5e6eea3dd3779c8f9e3f1fba", "parents": ["ced9ec19ae97080974d34d622381badf4370677c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083950 - Only count changes made this frame in a tile cache's deferred dirty tests. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nA tile that isn't drawn, such as one on screen but outside its slice's clip, keeps\nits dirty rect until it is drawn. A deferred dirty test added that rect to the\nchanges it tests against every frame, so once a backdrop-filter's region covered\nsuch a tile, the backdrop was redrawn on every frame, although nothing under it\nhad changed. Scrolling page content with a backdrop-filter under the toolbar did\nthat. Only count tiles invalidated this frame: an older dirty rect was already\ntested when it was made.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335416\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_scroll_under_clip_1.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_scroll_under_clip_2.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/src/test_invalidation.rs"], "git_node": "112b765928e0e02d0533b9c18e9245fec1f3a108", "git_parents": ["64eb50a6f1ea672f603e40f5dcdddbb26fb31f92"], "node": "c94ac0062bcf96151d2f1c03b46efd2abf9c1874", "parents": ["f152e88a1bce09ec5e6eea3dd3779c8f9e3f1fba"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079476 - Pt 1 - Let a tiled surface draw its primitives into extra tasks besides its tiles. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nEach extra task covers a rect of the surface and gets the same dependencies as\nthe tiles. Nothing adds one yet.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335469\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/command_buffer.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/picture.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/surface.rs"], "git_node": "e44d6c1357295787029ce37e380d8946d6b6d367", "git_parents": ["112b765928e0e02d0533b9c18e9245fec1f3a108"], "node": "2d698f9b98edbb36de26055b9693a8cd753a1f0f", "parents": ["c94ac0062bcf96151d2f1c03b46efd2abf9c1874"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079476 - Pt 2 - Don't promote compositor surfaces in the areas backdrop-filters sample. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nA compositor surface isn't drawn into a slice's tiles, so a backdrop read from\nthe slice's primitives misses it. Before visibility, find the area each\nbackdrop-filter samples in its own slice and in the slices below it, and\npromote nothing to a compositor surface there. Elsewhere in those slices,\nsurfaces are still promoted.\n\nThe slices above are visited first, so which of their backdrop-filters are\ndrawn is known before a slice's surfaces are promoted. A slice's own\nbackdrop-filters are only found to be drawn as the slice is visited, after the\nprimitives behind them, so they count whether drawn or not.\n\nMerging the slices under a backdrop-filter into one atomic slice already keeps\noverlays out of it, so for now this only stops 8 bit underlays from being\npromoted there, rather than promoting and then cancelling them:\nunderlay-backdrop-filter-cancel now expects no underlays. The slices below\nare read from in the next patch.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335470\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/frame_builder.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/visibility.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/compositor-surface/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/compositor-surface/underlay-backdrop-filter-cancel.yaml"], "git_node": "eb0391b6be6bd7dc7ae15e39f7cd7f0d348daff1", "git_parents": ["e44d6c1357295787029ce37e380d8946d6b6d367"], "node": "602bc89a414850d0b2d46409a8b9e1f418baa32b", "parents": ["2d698f9b98edbb36de26055b9693a8cd753a1f0f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079476 - Pt 3 - Read a backdrop-filter's backdrop from the slices below its own instead of merging them. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nMerging everything behind a backdrop-filter into one atomic slice meant that\nscrolling content under it invalidated the whole slice every frame, and that\ncontent in an earlier primary slice, such as a remote browser under chrome,\nwas not seen at all.\n\nEach capture's sampled region is now drawn in the slices below from the same\ncommands as their tiles, and composited into the capture, when it is opened,\nbefore the backdrop slice's own primitives.\n\nThe backdrop is redrawn when what it reads from the slices below changes, or\nthey have dirty tiles in the sampled area. What each capture read last frame is\nkept: its region, and for each slice the sampled rect, its transform to the\ncapture and its background color. This catches changes that dirty none of the\nslices' tiles, such as a clip growing or a slice no longer being sampled, and\ndoesn't redraw the backdrop when it moves together with the slices below, as\nwhen panning while zoomed.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335471\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/frame_builder.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/picture.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_building.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/surface.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/visibility.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_above_slice_overlay.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_clip_grow_1.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_clip_grow_2.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_move_together_1.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_move_together_2.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_overlay.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_overlay_ref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_scroll_1.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_scroll_2.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_scroll_under_clip_1.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_scroll_under_clip_2.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_underlay.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_underlay_ref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_unsampled_1.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_unsampled_2.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_own_slice_overlay_control.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_own_slice_overlay_inside.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_own_slice_overlay_inside_ref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_own_slice_overlay_outside.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/filters/backdrop-cross-slice-invisible-ref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/filters/backdrop-cross-slice-invisible.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/filters/backdrop-cross-slice-partial-ref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/filters/backdrop-cross-slice-partial.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/filters/backdrop-cross-slice-scaled-ref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/filters/backdrop-cross-slice-scaled.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/filters/backdrop-cross-slice-scroll-ref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/filters/backdrop-cross-slice-scroll.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/filters/backdrop-cross-slice-two-scrollers-ref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/filters/backdrop-cross-slice-two-scrollers.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/filters/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/src/test_invalidation.rs"], "git_node": "f17236e2e7b5b7d29fe292b9346a630bb6b0a8d8", "git_parents": ["eb0391b6be6bd7dc7ae15e39f7cd7f0d348daff1"], "node": "c684e4873470f1a433fb3851f175ae60f1d061ff", "parents": ["602bc89a414850d0b2d46409a8b9e1f418baa32b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079476 - Pt 4 - Apply a lower slice's rounded compositor clip to the backdrop read from it. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nThe clip is applied when the slice's tiles are composited, not to its\nprimitives, so the backdrop read from those primitives was missing it. The\nclip is also part of what a capture reads from the slice, so the backdrop is\nredrawn when it changes.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335472\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/picture.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_radius_1.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_radius_2.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_rounded.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/invalidation/backdrop_cross_slice_rounded_ref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/src/test_invalidation.rs"], "git_node": "753ca7dfc4d0a391b99cf35155117cea4de175e5", "git_parents": ["f17236e2e7b5b7d29fe292b9346a630bb6b0a8d8"], "node": "f54057f68924c0e85694c3430b4907ee73787706", "parents": ["c684e4873470f1a433fb3851f175ae60f1d061ff"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Import translations from https://github.com/mozilla-l10n/android-l10n CLOSED TREE\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-hr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-lv/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-hr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/main/res/values-hr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-hr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/summarize/src/main/res/values-hr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-bn/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-bqi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-cs/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-el/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-es-rCL/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-eu/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-fi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-gn/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-hr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-hu/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-it/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-kmr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-lv/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-nn-rNO/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-pa-rIN/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-sk/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-sl/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-tr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-zh-rTW/strings.xml", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/res/values-fi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/res/values-hr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/res/values-sk/strings.xml"], "git_node": "72db2db00efe3a98afc7b7d29d741af4ed9933ec", "git_parents": ["753ca7dfc4d0a391b99cf35155117cea4de175e5"], "node": "fe36c8d8ee42c3c5c01bf737f0b0ddedb35d0562", "parents": ["f54057f68924c0e85694c3430b4907ee73787706"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Reem H \u003c42309026+reemhamz@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070270 - Standardize widgets search UI. r=fluent-reviewers,nina-py,bolsson\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333448\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Weather/LocationSearch.jsx", "browser/ext