thor": "serge-sans-paille \u003csguelton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079602 - Replace mozilla::MakeUnique by std::make_unique r=nika,geckoview-reviewers,ipc-reviewers,application-update-reviewers,media-playback-reviewers,webrtc-reviewers,cookie-reviewers,places-reviewers,profiler-reviewers,win-reviewers,dom-storage-reviewers,permissions-reviewers,firefox-style-system-reviewers,layout-reviewers,dom-worker-reviewers,sandbox-reviewers,gtk-reviewers,webdriver-reviewers,geoprovider-reviewers,crashreporting-reviewers,device-api-reviewers,media-webspeech-reviewers,manuel,mossop,Sasha,saschanaz,bobowen,dshin,jfkthame,chutten,emz,gstoll,jari,bwc,gsvelto,padenot,canova,asuth,emilio,yjuglaret,azebrowski,valentin\n\nObsolete mozilla::MakeUnique which is just an alias to std::make_unique\nanyway. That way it's clear we're using a standard container.\n\nThe change is purely mechanical and was generated through the following\nsequence:\n\ngit grep -l mozilla::MakeUnique | xargs sed -i -e 's/\\\u003cmozilla::MakeUnique\\\u003e/std::make_unique/g'\ngit grep -l \"using std::make_unique\" | xargs sed -i -e '/using std::make_unique;/ d'\ngit grep -l MakeUnique | xargs sed -r -i -e 's/\\\u003cMakeUnique\\\u003e/std::make_unique/g'\ngit grep -l js::std::make_unique | xargs sed -r -i -e 's/js::std::make_unique/js::MakeUnique/g'\n\nThe js/ directory required a few more iterations as js::MakeUnique and\nmozilla::MakeUnique produce different types, but that was a minor\neffort. I went manually through each of the change as a double-check,\nand strong typing helps a lot there anyway.\n\nAlso minor adjustment to markdown file, reset of js/public/UniquePtr.h\nand removal of mozilla::MakeUnique from mfbt.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332395\n", "files": ["accessible/base/AccAttributes.h", "accessible/base/CachedTableAccessible.cpp", "accessible/generic/LocalAccessible.cpp", "accessible/windows/msaa/CompatibilityUIA.cpp", "accessib