ackground executor while closeCamera() can release the output surfaces on the\nmain thread, making setRepeatingRequest throw IllegalArgumentException.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337341\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/qr/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/qr/QrFragment.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/qr/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/qr/QrFragmentTest.kt"], "git_node": "c04b224419fef4c6769b1f18a61a57b1b1be2aca", "git_parents": ["e2449f19066ce58669fd4397467487aad58472b5"], "node": "46d3abb592bc754be2f0735bbac2808a572b36a6", "parents": ["c03e8b3daa4887ef8fbfabcc3d68f49112eb72fc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Denis Palmeiro \u003cdpalmeiro@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084288 - Force a GC before Speedometer and use the release delay for the user-inactive shrinking GC in Raptor. r=perftest-reviewers,sparky\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336847\n", "files": ["testing/profiles/raptor/user.js", "testing/raptor/browsertime/utils/profiling.js"], "git_node": "12d7a254c57a94b20dc1ed3f60ec4e5782025873", "git_parents": ["c04b224419fef4c6769b1f18a61a57b1b1be2aca"], "node": "1d0dee2ed14bf987c2b61335f891c9c1554165b1", "parents": ["46d3abb592bc754be2f0735bbac2808a572b36a6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081536 - remove USE_ICE and USE_TURN defines. r=bwc\n\nWe always build with them enabled so they're just noise in the code.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333456\n", "files": ["dom/media/webrtc/transport/test/turn_unittest.cpp", "dom/media/webrtc/transport/third_party/nICEr/nicer.gyp", "dom/media/webrtc/transport/third_party/nICEr/src/ice/ice_candidate.cpp", "dom/media/webrtc/transport/third_party/nICEr/src/ice/ice_component.cpp", "dom/media/webrtc/transport/third_party/nICEr/src/ice/ice_ctx.cp