are unknown types deeply;r=bwc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334309\n", "files": ["dom/media/webrtc/jsep/JsepSessionImpl.cpp", "dom/media/webrtc/jsep/JsepTransceiver.h", "testing/web-platform/tests/webrtc/protocol/unknown-media-types-negotiation.html"], "git_node": "8921dbafecdb9962ce8f96ea29f9a3512d183b8f", "git_parents": ["216ea720eefd8e58244f91012942db3260c0e308"], "node": "c861f7be5531df07a1be7774fbe0d0e3e2c9c402", "parents": ["86212ee845c6f070561482dc019d60f85713e40a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Grunbaum \u003cngrunbaum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072767 - add reconnection test;r=bwc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337730\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/webrtc/protocol/unknown-media-types-negotiation.html"], "git_node": "043c8d09653ca14454bb9887cd9f037ddb96331d", "git_parents": ["8921dbafecdb9962ce8f96ea29f9a3512d183b8f"], "node": "3f3a8468c670b03e14f5ecd97bf0368e5e7d82a1", "parents": ["c861f7be5531df07a1be7774fbe0d0e3e2c9c402"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Grunbaum \u003cngrunbaum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1617035 - use webrtc-sdp in nightly;r=mjf\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321333\n", "files": ["modules/libpref/init/all.js"], "git_node": "bc4f1b57eeb635ceeb3634e41aba7f4279fc140e", "git_parents": ["043c8d09653ca14454bb9887cd9f037ddb96331d"], "node": "30f1575a5321fac2c0f763e7ef91793a8fe47bfd", "parents": ["3f3a8468c670b03e14f5ecd97bf0368e5e7d82a1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Grunbaum \u003cngrunbaum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1617035 - make webrtc-sdp exclusive in nightly;r=mjf\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321336\n", "files": ["modules/libpref/init/all.js"], "git_node": "1ca120ecedf1dee69b32fbd9c16a06b3e5f2200a", "git_parents": ["bc4f1b57eeb635ceeb3634e41aba7f4279fc140e"], "node": "e60bdd110cf7401be9319ae63549a87fe3f0cd09", "parents": ["30f1575a5321fac2c0f763e7ef91793a8fe47bfd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chun-Min Chang \u003ccchang@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050150 - Add a gtest for the NV12 destination stride contract. r=media-playback-reviewers,alwu\n\nChecks that a stride too narrow for an interleaved chroma row is declined and\nthat even widths still convert: seven odd-width cases and five even controls.\n\nBoth source formats are covered, because the RGB branch is the default for\nhardware-decoded input, and so are the same-size and rescaled paths, since\nVideoFrame::Format::IsValidSize rejects an odd-width I420 frame and only the\nrescaled path can present one.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317996\n", "files": ["dom/media/gtest/TestImageConversion.cpp"], "git_node": "2f66764b4dcc45af1fd924ab9555fee29af1c7b3", "git_parents": ["1ca120ecedf1dee69b32fbd9c16a06b3e5f2200a"], "node": "2f8016587aed61d4b28e01c0b2a951ea08e099f4", "parents": ["e60bdd110cf7401be9319ae63549a87fe3f0cd09"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chun-Min Chang \u003ccchang@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050150 - Add a gtest for the WMF encoder module's frame-size predicate. r=media-playback-reviewers,alwu\n\nCovers the predicate directly. A test driving Supports() would return empty on\nany host without a VP8 or VP9 encoder, and so would pass without exercising it.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317997\n", "files": ["dom/media/gtest/TestWMFEncoderModule.cpp", "dom/media/gtest/moz.build"], "git_node": "291ec98f0d87d55a863e3d9a10e79342282893a6", "git_parents": ["2f66764b4dcc45af1fd924ab9555fee29af1c7b3"], "node": "7d8db8d59ce9ecb78cdeea6dfc1b4aee9ffaf039", "parents": ["2f8016587aed61d4b28e01c0b2a951ea08e099f4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chun-Min Chang \u003ccchang@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050150 - Add a WebCodecs test for per-codec dimension parity. r=media-playback-reviewers,alwu\n\nNeither requirement had coverage: H.264 must decline an odd dimension, since\n4:2:0 cannot express one, while VP8 and VP9 can express one and must keep\nworking.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317998\n", "files": ["dom/media/webcodecs/test/mochitest.toml", "dom/media/webcodecs/test/test_videoEncoder_oddWidth.html"], "git_node": "591156372aebf8e089274d5f50d3b8d5070903a1", "git_parents": ["291ec98f0d87d55a863e3d9a10e79342282893a6"], "node": "bee71110c63bdc41196c33ec5d5346d5260bd389", "parents": ["7d8db8d59ce9ecb78cdeea6dfc1b4aee9ffaf039"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Julien Cristau \u003cjcristau@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087041 - Create the blob upload directory in firefox_ui_tests.py. r=releng-reviewers,bhearsum DONTBUILD\n\nIt is declared as a task artifact, and was only being created by the\nresource monitor before bug 2086587.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337974\n", "files": ["testing/mozharness/scripts/firefox_ui_tests.py"], "git_node": "45c0613dfbd4a34e112931553052ccf192294057", "git_parents": ["591156372aebf8e089274d5f50d3b8d5070903a1"], "node": "36a8ebfed1f12bb71fcdae9ce0ecf98209217a78", "parents": ["bee71110c63bdc41196c33ec5d5346d5260bd389"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2050150 - Add a WebCodecs test for per-codec dimension parity. r=media-playback-reviewers,alwu\" for causing Linting failures.\n\nThis reverts commit 591156372aebf8e089274d5f50d3b8d5070903a1.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2050150 - Add a gtest for the WMF encoder module's frame-size predicate. r=media-playback-reviewers,alwu\"\n\nThis reverts commit 291ec98f0d87d55a863e3d9a10e79342282893a6.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2050150 - Add a gtest for the NV12 destination stride contract. r=media-playback-reviewers,alwu\"\n\nThis reverts commit 2f66764b4dcc45af1fd924ab9555fee29af1c7b3.\n", "files": ["dom/media/gtest/TestImageConversion.cpp", "dom/media/gtest/TestWMFEncoderModule.cpp", "dom/media/gtest/moz.build", "dom/media/webcodecs/test/mochitest.toml", "dom/media/webcodecs/test/test_videoEncoder_oddWidth.html"], "git_node": "aff1925618a90096104047dedb2ecc66c7963aab", "git_parents": ["45c0613dfbd4a34e112931553052ccf192294057"], "node": "b6da9ca1d86cae0c68086b73ac53b1fae883102d", "parents": ["36a8ebfed1f12bb71fcdae9ce0ecf98209217a78"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Niklas Baumgardner \u003cnbaumgardner@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080904 - Add migration telemetry event for quatity migrated and quantity availble per resource. r=settings-reviewers,hjones,mconley\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334199\n", "files": ["browser/components/migration/360seMigrationUtils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/migration/ChromeProfileMigrator.sys.mjs", "browser/components/migration/MigrationUtils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/migration/MigrationWizardChild.sys.mjs", "browser/components/migration/MigrationWizardParent.sys.mjs", "browser/components/migration/MigratorBase.sys.mjs", "browser/components/migration/SafariProfileMigrator.sys.mjs", "browser/components/migration/content/migration-dialog-window.js", "browser/components/migration/metrics.yaml", "browser/components/migration/tests/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/migration/tests/browser/browser_resource_migrated_telemetry.js", "browser/components/migration/tests/browser/head.js", "browser/components/migration/tests/unit/head_migration.js", "browser/components/migration/tests/unit/test_360se_bookmarks.js", "browser/components/migration/tests/unit/test_Chrome_bookmarks.js", "browser/components/migration/tests/unit/test_Chrome_formdata.js", "browser/components/migration/tests/unit/test_Chrome_history.js", "browser/components/migration/tests/unit/test_Chrome_passwords.js", "browser/components/migration/tests/unit/test_Safari_bookmarks.js", "browser/components/migration/tests/unit/test_Safari_history.js", "browser/components/preferences/config/account-sync.mjs", "browser/components/preferences/main.js"], "git_node": "0ff34a5cc5652aead7867255fe723596b390e3ce", "git_parents": ["aff1925618a90096104047dedb2ecc66c7963aab"], "node": "7533b4c4fb7386dae18a261ce524052fc07c6f73", "parents": ["b6da9ca1d86cae0c68086b73ac53b1fae883102d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087095 - Fix Android Java code flagged by newer javac lint checks. r=android-reviewers,geckoview-reviewers,jonalmeida\n\nNewer javac versions add the dangling-doc-comments, lossy-conversions and this-escape checks. This fixes the\nsites outside the GeckoView public API; the remaining this-escape sites need API changes.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338058\n", "files": ["mobile/android/annotations/src/main/java/org/mozilla/gecko/annotationProcessors/SDKProcessor.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/test/rule/GeckoSessionTestRule.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/gecko/GeckoSystemStateListener.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/gecko/mozglue/SharedMemory.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/gecko/process/GeckoProcessType.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/gecko/process/GeckoServiceChildProcess.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/Autofill.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/GeckoInputStream.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/GeckoSessionSettings.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/WebRequestError.java", "mobile/android/geckoview_example/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview_example/LocationView.java", "mobile/android/geckoview_example/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview_example/NestedGeckoView.java", "mobile/android/geckoview_example/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview_example/ToolbarLayout.java"], "git_node": "8ecd1dc20ef05633dd8747195ea18b5b5bf2c3c8", "git_parents": ["0ff34a5cc5652aead7867255fe723596b390e3ce"], "node": "a09c8eeb6e3124550a6b878a17c6665aa9806b05", "parents": ["7533b4c4fb7386dae18a261ce524052fc07c6f73"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087095 - Fix GeckoView javadoc issues reported by newer javadoc versions. r=geckoview-reviewers,crashreporting-reviewers,jonalmeida\n\nThe explicit public constructors replace implicit ones that api.txt already lists, so the API is unchanged.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338059\n", "files": ["mobile/android/geckoview/checkstyle.xml", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/AIFeaturesController.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/Autocomplete.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/Autofill.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/ContentBlocking.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/ContentBlockingController.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/CrashHandler.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/CrashPullController.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/CrashReporter.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/DeprecationSchedule.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/GeckoPreferenceController.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/GeckoResult.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/GeckoRuntimeSettings.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/GeckoSession.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/GeckoView.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/MediaSession.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/PageExtractionController.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/PanZoomController.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/PdfViewerController.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/PictureInPictureController.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/ProfilerController.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/RuntimeSettings.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/StorageController.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/TranslationsController.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/WebExtension.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/WebExtensionController.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/WebRequest.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/WebResponse.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/doc-files/CHANGELOG.md"], "git_node": "cd5e5d490b33825c4b5c7bac8032df5b42cd28fe", "git_parents": ["8ecd1dc20ef05633dd8747195ea18b5b5bf2c3c8"], "node": "c77f75d3a012d74eef58974d8b9a153900812543", "parents": ["a09c8eeb6e3124550a6b878a17c6665aa9806b05"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087095 - Use locales with unchanged CLDR data on newer JDKs in two Android unit tests. r=android-reviewers,jonalmeida\n\nNewer JDKs format plain \"ar\" numbers with Latin digits and know a display name for \"vec\", which broke the\nassumptions of IntTest and LocaleViewHoldersTest.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338060\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/base/src/test/java/mozilla/components/compose/base/utils/IntTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/advanced/LocaleViewHoldersTest.kt"], "git_node": "b8f937edd0fcaf9a2e5d3edf87aefa49d60aec82", "git_parents": ["cd5e5d490b33825c4b5c7bac8032df5b42cd28fe"], "node": "867f4573fff2174d060f16d56fa6f5ca662919a4", "parents": ["c77f75d3a012d74eef58974d8b9a153900812543"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Bryan Olsson \u003cbolsson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086282 - Use overflow-wrap: anywhere for moz-box-item descriptions. r=reusable-components-reviewers,mkennedy\n\nword-break: break-all split ordinary words mid-word in every locale. overflow-wrap: anywhere still breaks long URLs when they would overflow.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337316\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/widgets/moz-box-item/moz-box-item.css"], "git_node": "0b1f2a76657e99e9c298da4503bcd8737aa303d5", "git_parents": ["b8f937edd0fcaf9a2e5d3edf87aefa49d60aec82"], "node": "819bcd14901dfcf59149df5321b24c5bdcb6abde", "parents": ["867f4573fff2174d060f16d56fa6f5ca662919a4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Olivia Hall \u003cohall@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081257 - Add PDF viewer tools to custom tabs r=jonalmeida,android-reviewers,mobiletest-reviewers,aaronmt\n\nPatch enables the PDF viewers on custom tabs by moving initialization from\n`BrowserFragment` to `BaseBrowserFragment`. Other changes are to support the shift (mostly accommodating\nlooking for a custom tab id).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337290\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/helpers/FeatureSettingsHelper.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/helpers/FeatureSettingsHelperDelegate.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/CustomTabsTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/robots/CustomTabRobot.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/browser/BaseBrowserFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/browser/BrowserFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/pdf/PdfToolsIntegration.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/pdf/PdfToolsIntegrationTest.kt"], "git_node": "e77aa0c90530d39880213f84dacb18aa3512edaf", "git_parents": ["0b1f2a76657e99e9c298da4503bcd8737aa303d5"], "node": "f212af328e6c0eb0d3b7cf9466c3927ae79b1ab5", "parents": ["819bcd14901dfcf59149df5321b24c5bdcb6abde"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 1617035, Bug 2072767 - make webrtc-sdp exclusive in nightly;r=mjf\" for causing failures at NewSdpTest.CheckAv1Fmtp.\n\nThis reverts commit 1ca120ecedf1dee69b32fbd9c16a06b3e5f2200a.\n\nRevert \"Bug 1617035 - use webrtc-sdp in nightly;r=mjf\"\n\nThis reverts commit bc4f1b57eeb635ceeb3634e41aba7f4279fc140e.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2072767 - add reconnection test;r=bwc\"\n\nThis reverts commit 043c8d09653ca14454bb9887cd9f037ddb96331d.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2072767 - compare unknown types deeply;r=bwc\"\n\nThis reverts commit 8921dbafecdb9962ce8f96ea29f9a3512d183b8f.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2072767 - recycle unknown media type m-sections;r=bwc\"\n\nThis reverts commit 216ea720eefd8e58244f91012942db3260c0e308.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2072767 - reserve mid for unknown media types;r=bwc\"\n\nThis reverts commit e42bf0e4b3ee13ac9175c1b620f1a0ba0e7933d7.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2072767 - add more tests for unknown media types;r=bwc\"\n\nThis reverts commit 4186bff10bc9eeaff4b4da54cfc12ca00d0b97db.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2072767 - set port=0 in m-sections with unknown media types in answers;r=bwc\"\n\nThis reverts commit 098f55199b3d8eb599e3516e550aff6db5babc66.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2072767 - restore handling of unknown media types for webrtc-sdp;r=dbaker,bwc\"\n\nThis reverts commit 0b3f57fe3143bba8c44ae9723055b68e21342189.\n", "files": ["dom/media/webrtc/jsapi/PeerConnectionImpl.cpp", "dom/media/webrtc/jsep/JsepSessionImpl.cpp", "dom/media/webrtc/jsep/JsepSessionImpl.h", "dom/media/webrtc/jsep/JsepTrack.cpp", "dom/media/webrtc/jsep/JsepTransceiver.h", "dom/media/webrtc/sdp/RsdparsaSdpParser.cpp", "dom/media/webrtc/sdp/SdpHelper.cpp", "dom/media/webrtc/sdp/SdpMediaSection.h", "dom/media/webrtc/sdp/SdpMediaSectionImpl.h", "dom/media/webrtc/sdp/rsdparsa_capi/src/lib.rs", "media/webrtc/signaling/gtest/sdp_unittests.cpp", "modules/libpref/init/all.js", "testing/web-platform/meta/webrtc/protocol/transceiver-mline-recycling.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/webrtc/protocol/unknown-media-types-negotiation.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/webrtc/protocol/unknown-mediatypes.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/tests/webrtc/protocol/unknown-media-types-negotiation.html"], "git_node": "5811a28bf32a7b49d94314a4039c00770a431abf", "git_parents": ["e77aa0c90530d39880213f84dacb18aa3512edaf"], "node": "42eea58d6ec14d687e0025265337f4c0028086c3", "parents": ["f212af328e6c0eb0d3b7cf9466c3927ae79b1ab5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2038777 - Make privilegedabout implicitly COOP, r=mconley,mccr8,tabbrowser-reviewers,dao\" for causing failures at browser_bug1682866.js.\n\nThis reverts commit 5f3e805831460c59a9e3d92377b42f25f6d784fe.\n", "files": ["browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser.toml", "browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser_new_tab_in_privilegedabout_process_pref.js", "browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser_privilegedabout_popup_opener.js", "dom/ipc/ProcessIsolation.cpp"], "git_node": "ac123acac5476e15a294dbfce7d0761e082d81e5", "git_parents": ["5811a28bf32a7b49d94314a4039c00770a431abf"], "node": "76c6df5b96639bcd993dc9d0ad65d8d2d14b2644", "parents": ["42eea58d6ec14d687e0025265337f4c0028086c3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Cristian Tuns \u003cctuns@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2086305 - Use DrawSurface more often for SkPDF. r=lsalzman\" for causing wp failures in video-001-print.html\n\nThis reverts commit bc36bffe55930bbb6d73c06d0c346643a073f03e.\n", "files": ["gfx/2d/DrawTargetSkia.cpp", "toolkit/components/printing/tests/browser.toml", "toolkit/components/printing/tests/browser_print_image_output.js", "toolkit/components/printing/tests/browser_print_page_size_output.js", "toolkit/components/printing/tests/file_print_images.html", "toolkit/components/printing/tests/head.js"], "git_node": "4fae7c15486893414e53cbed1fc3bb029037e76a", "git_parents": ["ac123acac5476e15a294dbfce7d0761e082d81e5"], "node": "9e85f63fd12db7e74b2b189d3faa6aaeaf0e30d6", "parents": ["76c6df5b96639bcd993dc9d0ad65d8d2d14b2644"], "tags": []}, {"author": "James Teow \u003cjteow@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087027 - Avoid showing temporal search query when they match a recent search - r=adw,urlbar-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337993\n", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarMuxerStandard.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarProviderRecentSearches.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/quicksuggest/browser/browser_quicksuggest_temporal_zeroPrefixLayout.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/unit/test_providerRecentSearches.js"], "git_node": "e7c915bc6d01ad8e14a9500f2c4ca896df04e793", "git_parents": ["4fae7c15486893414e53cbed1fc3bb029037e76a"], "node": "6c155f4e2def7aaaf56db5da8fedcb66bd54a547", "parents": ["9e85f63fd12db7e74b2b189d3faa6aaeaf0e30d6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dimi Lee \u003cdlee@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087061 - Always switch back to the JSON store when the Rust storage pref is turned off. r=theidkamp,credential-management-reviewers\n\nThis ensures users can always be rolled back to the JSON store if there is any\nissue with the Rust store.\n\nA failed copy back used to leave the profile on Rust, and after three failures\nnothing ever tried again. The copy back is no longer limited by the attempt\nbudget, and the switch happens even if the copy fails or the Rust records cannot\nbe read.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337998\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/formautofill/test/unit/test_rust_autofill_address_migration.js", "browser/extensions/formautofill/test/unit/test_rust_autofill_credit_card_migration.js", "toolkit/components/formautofill/AutofillStorageMigrator.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/formautofill/default/FormAutofillStorage.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/formautofill/metrics.yaml"], "git_node": "0503318ebb9a51d3647a095b1af37c987bad29eb", "git_parents": ["e7c915bc6d01ad8e14a9500f2c4ca896df04e793"], "node": "c98fb9af0ba93b397be0a33fa6d3fcde76d1a3e7", "parents": ["6c155f4e2def7aaaf56db5da8fedcb66bd54a547"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jens Stutte \u003cjstutte@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082797 - Annotate why the omni.ja canary module load failed. r=xpcom-reviewers,crashreporting-reviewers,afranchuk,nika\n\nThe script filename filter of background hang reports moves to a shared\nheader so the annotation reports exception locations the same way. It now\nalso keeps the path of moz-src:/// URLs.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334454\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/backgroundhangmonitor/ChromeScriptPath.h", "toolkit/components/backgroundhangmonitor/ThreadStackHelper.cpp", "toolkit/components/backgroundhangmonitor/moz.build", "toolkit/components/backgroundhangmonitor/tests/gtest/TestChromeScriptPath.cpp", "toolkit/components/backgroundhangmonitor/tests/gtest/moz.build", "toolkit/crashreporter/CrashAnnotations.yaml", "toolkit/xre/nsAppRunner.cpp"], "git_node": "af3bec5a9f32fb038a097fcab8de6aa77cebdb51", "git_parents": ["0503318ebb9a51d3647a095b1af37c987bad29eb"], "node": "a6d0e49797455e165ec96ebf631f1c3fb5247a0a", "parents": ["c98fb9af0ba93b397be0a33fa6d3fcde76d1a3e7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Banner \u003cstandard8@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064712 - In the address bar code, report the partner code and telemetry id from the search submission url when recording searches. r=urlbar-reviewers,jteow,search-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337984\n", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarParentController.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarUtils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/actors/UrlbarParent.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/content/UrlbarInputBase.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/content/UrlbarParentControllerProxy.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-search/browser.toml", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-search/browser_partnerCode_urlbar.js", "toolkit/components/search/SearchUtils.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "cda5a1107ec7087fb8f78906bf938437439b532e", "git_parents": ["af3bec5a9f32fb038a097fcab8de6aa77cebdb51"], "node": "20e82b40b879946eac5b2fa2bff69d0fc6251e70", "parents": ["a6d0e49797455e165ec96ebf631f1c3fb5247a0a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Banner \u003cstandard8@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064712 - In the smartbar code, report the partner code and telemetry id from the search submission url when recording searches. r=urlbar-reviewers,jteow\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337985\n", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarParentController.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/actors/UrlbarParent.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/content/SmartbarInput.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/content/UrlbarInputBase.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/content/UrlbarParentControllerProxy.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-search/browser.toml", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-search/browser_partnerCode_smartbar.js"], "git_node": "a35904786e73e29b1ca1e205166c60bf3c2019c3", "git_parents": ["cda5a1107ec7087fb8f78906bf938437439b532e"], "node": "e9e6ad7be780ce71b8910e28dce9ff23c9967dc2", "parents": ["20e82b40b879946eac5b2fa2bff69d0fc6251e70"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Banner \u003cstandard8@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064712 - Add SAP partner code handling to the legacy search bar. r=search-reviewers,jteow\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337986\n", "files": ["browser/components/search/content/searchbar.js", "browser/components/search/test/browser/telemetry/browser.toml", "browser/components/search/test/browser/telemetry/browser_search_telemetry_searchbar.js"], "git_node": "8c608a323ac52c06eff4e1dde859da8ad274cf7f", "git_parents": ["a35904786e73e29b1ca1e205166c60bf3c2019c3"], "node": "207c8ba373b1b0a905a49d923901db9d8027de9c", "parents": ["e9e6ad7be780ce71b8910e28dce9ff23c9967dc2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew Gaul \u003candrew@gaul.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080692 - wasm: store constant struct fields without a register in Ion. r=yury\n\nIon lowers every MWasmStoreField value to a register, so storing a constant\nto a struct field, for example while initializing a new struct, first\nmaterializes it:\n\n  mov  w0, #0\n  str  w0, [x1, #0x28]\n\nAdd LIRGeneratorShared::canStoreConstantWithoutRegister, false by default,\nand lower such constants as constant allocations. visitWasmStoreSlot and\nvisitWasmStoreSlotI64 then store them with the immediate forms of\nstore8/16/32/64, which now return a FaultingCodeRange on every platform so\nthe store remains the null-check trap site.\n\narm64 accepts a constant zero, which it stores from the zero register:\n\n  str  wzr, [x1, #0x28]\n\nx86 and x64 accept any integer constant that fits in 32 bits, as\nvisitWasmStore already does for wasm memory:\n\n  movl $-0x02, 0x14(%rdi)\n\nOn a JetStream 3 run on arm64 this removes 5,115 instructions from Ion wasm\ncode.\n\nFound with armlint.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332796\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/gc/struct-store-const.js", "js/src/jit/CodeGenerator.cpp", "js/src/jit/Lowering.cpp", "js/src/jit/arm/MacroAssembler-arm.cpp", "js/src/jit/arm/MacroAssembler-arm.h", "js/src/jit/arm64/Lowering-arm64.cpp", "js/src/jit/arm64/Lowering-arm64.h", "js/src/jit/arm64/MacroAssembler-arm64.h", "js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64.cpp", "js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64.h", "js/src/jit/mips64/MacroAssembler-mips64.cpp", "js/src/jit/mips64/MacroAssembler-mips64.h", "js/src/jit/shared/Lowering-shared.h", "js/src/jit/x64/Lowering-x64.cpp", "js/src/jit/x64/Lowering-x64.h", "js/src/jit/x64/MacroAssembler-x64.h", "js/src/jit/x86-shared/MacroAssembler-x86-shared.h", "js/src/jit/x86/Lowering-x86.h"], "git_node": "cb19a5936df26cddb9983fe023b85f433b908f52", "git_parents": ["8c608a323ac52c06eff4e1dde859da8ad274cf7f"], "node": "ceb6b8e3e4dab86417739fc5add23a10ef3c7d1b", "parents": ["207c8ba373b1b0a905a49d923901db9d8027de9c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-central repo-update remote-settings tld-suffixes ct-logs r=release-managers,dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338126\n", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/ct/CTKnownLogs.h", "security/manager/tools/log_list.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/newtab-wallpapers-v2.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/onecrl.json"], "git_node": "6363d0fc48c4fa007cfea9ba77d01bcd9dd2f800", "git_parents": ["cb19a5936df26cddb9983fe023b85f433b908f52"], "node": "8a7307015b51b897217d6d6e0df60f86a8ca8850", "parents": ["ceb6b8e3e4dab86417739fc5add23a10ef3c7d1b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "hannajones \u003chjones@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079894 - move createDefaultBrowserConfig out of main.js r=settings-reviewers,mconley\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332167\n", "files": ["browser/components/preferences/config/account-sync.mjs", "browser/components/preferences/config/default-browser.mjs", "browser/components/preferences/config/home-startup.mjs", "browser/components/preferences/jar.mn", "browser/components/preferences/main.js"], "git_node": "64addbb5da4aaa92eff676e885a15c8d625c0816", "git_parents": ["6363d0fc48c4fa007cfea9ba77d01bcd9dd2f800"], "node": "75f2b35c053b85bf7f4776e295e576a69e951e6b", "parents": ["8a7307015b51b897217d6d6e0df60f86a8ca8850"], "tags": []}, {"author": "hannajones \u003chjones@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079414 - move code from from the createStartupConfig method to home-startup.mjs from main.js r=settings-reviewers,mconley\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332168\n", "files": ["browser/components/preferences/config/home-startup.mjs", "browser/components/preferences/main.js"], "git_node": "e4cb0f7de19c45718789bb57a30b90c5886b35c2", "git_parents": ["64addbb5da4aaa92eff676e885a15c8d625c0816"], "node": "b272f3c38d373c806003b43858c58d1dbc01f2ba", "parents": ["75f2b35c053b85bf7f4776e295e576a69e951e6b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chun-Min Chang \u003cchun.m.chang@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081094 - Restore the conditioned profile for the browsertime WebCodecs tests r=perftest-reviewers,sparky\n\nBug 2073468 turned extra-options into a by-app value, which replaces the\ntask-defaults list instead of extending it, so these tests lost\n--conditioned-profile=settled.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336317\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/browsertime/desktop.yml"], "git_node": "02c25307a60d1207718572ef9d58edbff5a282f7", "git_parents": ["e4cb0f7de19c45718789bb57a30b90c5886b35c2"], "node": "f3a8f46af1768ddbd6adc246f9331ec6c56d757b", "parents": ["b272f3c38d373c806003b43858c58d1dbc01f2ba"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Qu\u00e8ze \u003cflorian@queze.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087103 - Wait for running chrome animations before testing promiseDocumentFlushed, r=mconley.\n\nOn macOS, the titlebar opacity transition that runs when a fresh window gets\nfocused made test_basic fail in the standalone variant.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338031\n", "files": ["dom/base/test/browser_promiseDocumentFlushed.js"], "git_node": "d427bb59c3e8f7a4341359a8f18f8e9ed5b2fb49", "git_parents": ["02c25307a60d1207718572ef9d58edbff5a282f7"], "node": "40a91dce8dc92da3fa8a947fd32b20f53584a54e", "parents": ["f3a8f46af1768ddbd6adc246f9331ec6c56d757b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Qu\u00e8ze \u003cflorian@queze.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087119 - Register and unregister tab notes window listeners without waiting for the database, r=tabbrowser-reviewers,sthompson.\n\nThe listeners were added only after the database opened, dropping canonical\nURLs reported meanwhile, and removed only after it closed, so a quick\nre-enable lost them. TabNotes initializes lazily, so neither needs to wait.\nTabNotes.deinit forgets its init immediately, else a re-enable during the\nclose queries the closing connection; it also closes an in-flight init, and\na new init waits for the close to avoid NS_ERROR_STORAGE_BUSY.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338038\n", "files": ["browser/components/tabnotes/TabNotes.sys.mjs", "browser/components/tabnotes/TabNotesController.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "75fcba685a34f24f98e8cad94c4ea933680747f6", "git_parents": ["d427bb59c3e8f7a4341359a8f18f8e9ed5b2fb49"], "node": "2f8812d0c09660f0e9738d51058b417792609b60", "parents": ["40a91dce8dc92da3fa8a947fd32b20f53584a54e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Qu\u00e8ze \u003cflorian@queze.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1996471 - Close the tab hover preview before browser_tab_splitview_contextmenu.js moves the tab strip, r=tabbrowser-reviewers,sthompson.\n\nAlso remove the macOS 15.30 aarch64 skip-if from bug 2023967, a blanket skip for the new arm workers.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338104\n", "files": ["browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser.toml", "browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser_tab_splitview_contextmenu.js"], "git_node": "baa998d0ad9a55506541dcbec4210e3d2190497e", "git_parents": ["75fcba685a34f24f98e8cad94c4ea933680747f6"], "node": "1f5356af37ef239ab42e8ece17e87e8bdcf6d09f", "parents": ["2f8812d0c09660f0e9738d51058b417792609b60"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Marco Castelluccio \u003cmcastelluccio@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1636088 - Use the logged group for tests and crashes in the errorsummary formatter. r=florian\n\nA crash for an unknown test no longer creates a bogus \"\" group_result.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328930\n", "files": ["testing/mozbase/mozlog/mozlog/formatters/errorsummary.py", "testing/mozbase/mozlog/tests/test_errorsummary.py"], "git_node": "1038664f5ef21086bf00e0c38d745a63eec32cc3", "git_parents": ["baa998d0ad9a55506541dcbec4210e3d2190497e"], "node": "e24bf1535bcc1876e4dc48eb4bd313b8e6df1b18", "parents": ["1f5356af37ef239ab42e8ece17e87e8bdcf6d09f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Marco Castelluccio \u003cmcastelluccio@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1636088 - Allow attributing crashes to a group in mozrunner, and bump mozcrash and mozrunner versions. r=whimboo,mozbase-reviewers\n\nmozcrash 2.3.0 can attribute crashes to a group, which needs a mozlog whose\ncrash action accepts it (the next release, 9.0.0).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335972\n", "files": ["testing/mozbase/mozcrash/setup.py", "testing/mozbase/mozrunner/mozrunner/base/runner.py", "testing/mozbase/mozrunner/setup.py", "testing/mozbase/mozrunner/tests/test_crash.py"], "git_node": "ac6d75edcc533ec5cc88f78fba5760244daeb88d", "git_parents": ["1038664f5ef21086bf00e0c38d745a63eec32cc3"], "node": "b12781f7108455e977812e72c831a5e7ba96341c", "parents": ["e24bf1535bcc1876e4dc48eb4bd313b8e6df1b18"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Marco Castelluccio \u003cmcastelluccio@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1636088 - Attribute Marionette crashes to the group being run. r=mozbase-reviewers,webdriver-reviewers,whimboo\n\nCrashes detected while no test name is set (after a test's tearDown, or\nbetween tests) are reported as \"marionette.py\", which can't be mapped to a\ngroup in errorsummary.log. The harness knows which group is running, so pass\nit along with the crash. This needs mozrunner 8.5.0 and mozcrash 2.3.0, which\naccept the group.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335081\n", "files": ["testing/marionette/client/marionette_driver/marionette.py", "testing/marionette/client/requirements.txt", "testing/marionette/harness/marionette_harness/runner/base.py", "testing/marionette/harness/marionette_harness/tests/harness_unit/python.toml", "testing/marionette/harness/marionette_harness/tests/harness_unit/test_marionette_check_for_crash.py", "testing/marionette/harness/marionette_harness/tests/harness_unit/test_marionette_runner.py", "testing/marionette/harness/requirements.txt"], "git_node": "2b19ab0105f3d461cd661ca7afb7185659a2a965", "git_parents": ["ac6d75edcc533ec5cc88f78fba5760244daeb88d"], "node": "6408e0c6736cfe4fdc803c436581fb83cd71da14", "parents": ["b12781f7108455e977812e72c831a5e7ba96341c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "hannajones \u003chjones@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059669 - Add gradient for sun theme preview in dark mode r=desktop-theme-reviewers,hjones,mossop\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329974\n", "files": ["browser/components/profiles/tests/browser/browser_edit_profile_theme_picker_test.js", "browser/themes/ThemesList.sys.mjs", "browser/themes/test/unit/test_ThemesList.js"], "git_node": "2d190e0fa90ad54aa69a9b4cb6da9c3f9e080f42", "git_parents": ["2b19ab0105f3d461cd661ca7afb7185659a2a965"], "node": "4768074bb1d7c1e024d84121f5606144154dd929", "parents": ["6408e0c6736cfe4fdc803c436581fb83cd71da14"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Striemer \u003cmstriemer@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081853 - Record theme_picker.native_theme/appearance metrics r=tgiles\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335819\n", "files": ["browser/modules/BrowserUsageTelemetry.sys.mjs", "browser/modules/metrics.yaml", "browser/modules/test/browser/browser_UsageTelemetry_idleDaily.js"], "git_node": "63e01097afce06017f569e77a71a5a8d0aae411c", "git_parents": ["2d190e0fa90ad54aa69a9b4cb6da9c3f9e080f42"], "node": "7e13c5d561f4fdef2494159577727209350d696c", "parents": ["4768074bb1d7c1e024d84121f5606144154dd929"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Markus Stange \u003cmstange.moz@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083996 - Let mozcrash accept a list of symbols paths and URLs. r=mozbase-reviewers,gsvelto,whimboo\n\nThe symbols for the gtest libxul are moving out of crashreporter-symbols.zip\ninto a separate zip, so gtest runs need symbols from both.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335456\n", "files": ["testing/mozbase/mozcrash/mozcrash/mozcrash.py", "testing/mozbase/mozcrash/tests/test_symbols_path.py"], "git_node": "48b7ebea9e5aa1c430f02bdcf3fdedb611418af9", "git_parents": ["63e01097afce06017f569e77a71a5a8d0aae411c"], "node": "c16da6acb0f2e2db39cfaf12a0a74363b1e30ecf", "parents": ["7e13c5d561f4fdef2494159577727209350d696c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Markus Stange \u003cmstange.moz@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083996 - Give gtest runs the symbols from crashreporter-symbols-gtest.zip. r=releng-reviewers,bhearsum\n\nThis prepares for moving the gtest libxul symbols out of\ncrashreporter-symbols.zip. When symbols are downloaded up front, the gtest zip\nis extracted into the same directory as the main zip. When they are downloaded\non demand, the harness receives both URLs and passes them to mozcrash. Builds\nwithout the gtest zip still get the main zip.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335457\n", "files": ["testing/gtest/remotegtests.py", "testing/gtest/rungtests.py", "testing/mozharness/mozharness/mozilla/testing/testbase.py", "testing/mozharness/scripts/android_emulator_unittest.py", "testing/mozharness/scripts/desktop_unittest.py"], "git_node": "07417b249839f140fe2de2ddfd13970bcea19a6e", "git_parents": ["48b7ebea9e5aa1c430f02bdcf3fdedb611418af9"], "node": "53e619272d42e857937adb696529c883a7caec10", "parents": ["c16da6acb0f2e2db39cfaf12a0a74363b1e30ecf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Markus Stange \u003cmstange.moz@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083996 - Put the symbols for gtest-only binaries into separate crashreporter-symbols-gtest archives. r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,taskgraph-reviewers,ahochheiden,jcristau,browser-installer-reviewers,spohl\n\nThe gtest libxul makes up about 40% of crashreporter-symbols.zip, but only gtest\ntasks need its symbols. Most other test tasks download the zip as well: debug\ntests at startup, and mochitest, xpcshell and browsertime tasks through fetches.\n\nAnd for shippable builds on autoland/central, we would previously upload these\ngtest symbols to the symbol server. As far as I'm aware that's always been a waste.\n\nSo this patch puts the gtest symbols into a separate zip file. This file\nonly gets pulled by gtest jobs, other jobs ignore it. We also stop uploading\nthe symbols to the symbol server.\n\nAs for the \"full\" symbols, I was unsure what to do with them. By \"full\" symbols\nwe mean native debug information, e.g. pdb files on Windows. We don't\nreally have any use for pdb files of gtests, unless you're actually dealing\nwith a crash in a gtest in CI that you need to debug with a native debugger.\nSo this patch makes it so that we don't output the gtest pdb unless you're on\ntry; and on try, they're made available as a separate artifact. Nothing uses that\nartifact, but it's there for this rare case.\nThis is loosely inspired by what we do with the other test-only pdb files, e.g.\nthe ones for cppunittests. For those we already have \"discard unless on try\"\nbehavior from bug 1473423.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335458\n", "files": ["Makefile.in", "config/rules.mk", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/action/dumpsymbols.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/action/symbols_archive.py", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/transforms/artifacts.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/build/macosx.yml", "taskcluster/scripts/misc/unify.sh", "toolkit/mozapps/installer/package-name.mk", "toolkit/mozapps/installer/upload-files.mk"], "git_node": "bf7b8d09f71c7323e4c9a0d1869e5d4beaa996e3", "git_parents": ["07417b249839f140fe2de2ddfd13970bcea19a6e"], "node": "f4547499a9ea5fbd77d5548d57ef9b3e6b5acb48", "parents": ["53e619272d42e857937adb696529c883a7caec10"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Import translations from https://github.com/mozilla-l10n/android-l10n CLOSED TREE\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-be/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/menu/src/main/res/values-az/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/toolbar/src/main/res/values-az/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/awesomebar/src/main/res/values-az/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/awesomebar/src/main/res/values-be/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/browser-toolbar/src/main/res/values-brh/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/downloads/src/main/res/values-az/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/downloads/src/main/res/values-brh/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/findinpage/src/main/res/values-brh/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/importer/src/main/res/values-brh/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-be/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-cs/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-dsb/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-fi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-fy-rNL/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-is/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-lv/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-pa-rIN/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-pt-rPT/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-tg/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-tr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/media/src/main/res/values-brh/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/password-importer/src/main/res/values-brh/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/prompts/src/main/res/values-brh/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/summarize/src/main/res/values-az/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/compo