 "testing/web-platform/meta/wasm/webapi/esm-integration/source-phase.tentative.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/wasm/webapi/esm-integration/wasm-import-wasm-export.tentative.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/wasm/webapi/esm-integration/wasm-import.tentative.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/wasm/webapi/esm-integration/wasm-js-cycle.tentative.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/wasm/webapi/esm-integration/wasm-to-wasm-link-error.tentative.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/wasm/webapi/esm-integration/worker-import.tentative.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/wasm/webapi/esm-integration/worker.tentative.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/wasm/webapi/esm-integration/worklet-import-source-phase.tentative.https.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/mozilla/meta/wasm/webapi/esm-integration/source-phase-eval-error.tentative.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/mozilla/meta/wasm/webapi/esm-integration/source-phase-then-eval-phase.tentative.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/mozilla/meta/wasm/webapi/esm-integration/worklet.tentative.https.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/mozilla/tests/wasm/webapi/esm-integration/source-phase-eval-error.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/mozilla/tests/wasm/webapi/esm-integration/source-phase-then-eval-phase.tentative.html"], "git_node": "5d92eeb33763d7b06124f051a8b1f6efe0909a5c", "git_parents": ["32af0f3bb6b323c1c660d70ecbad4e64479c09f5"], "node": "17a357b386f3b542e81732a05a842cec128088a9", "parents": ["267c91ebd74745334fce236818e6b7b268e9ce6a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Micah Killoran \u003cmtigley@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086203 - Add Glean probes for the card security code prompts. r=credential-management-reviewers,NeilDeakin\n\nRecord cvv_prompt_shown and cvv_prompt_action when a card doorhanger offers\nto save a security code the user entered, including when the doorhanger goes\naway without a response, to measure security code opt-in and declines.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337729\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/formautofill/test/browser/creditCard/browser.toml", "browser/extensions/formautofill/test/browser/creditCard/browser_creditCard_telemetry_cvv_prompt.js", "toolkit/components/formautofill/default/FormAutofillPrompter.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/formautofill/metrics.yaml", "toolkit/components/formautofill/shared/AutofillTelemetry.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "6fa4788507be472b8112d48e93b39e6120f4954a", "git_parents": ["5d92eeb33763d7b06124f051a8b1f6efe0909a5c"], "node": "139c538ad291995dc7419d339aea03b3db0b4037", "parents": ["17a357b386f3b542e81732a05a842cec128088a9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephanie Cunnane \u003cscunnane@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086855 - Fix dismissal issues with text selection menu. r=echa\n\nFor background on the Highlight to Search project, here is [[ https://docs.google.com/document/d/1lpprhnIKYbXSNnVE-OSmVcE1Vpm9_vBBIKIOjW8_0lE/edit?tab=t.os3nbc21wjhe | the current spec ]].\n\nTo manually experiment with this feature, here is [[ https://searchux.netlify.app/highlight-to-search/ | the UX prototype ]].\n\nWith the feature gate on, Escape closes an open dropdown and then the strip, and a double or triple click no longer closes the strip, as in the prototype.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337804\n", "files": ["browser/components/genai/GenAI.sys.mjs", "browser/components/genai/GenAIChild.sys.mjs", "browser/components/genai/GenAIParent.sys.mjs", "browser/components/genai/tests/browser/browser_chat_shortcuts.js"], "git_node": "ca007f7b32a32be5d5a017aa844bea28ee638ce1", "git_parents": ["6fa4788507be472b8112d48e93b39e6120f4954a"], "node": "a1bd02adf0285688b6b19443f4d2a7a991c21571", "parents": ["139c538ad291995dc7419d339aea03b3db0b4037"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephen A Pohl \u003cspohl@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084861: Apply about:keyboard shortcuts to the macOS windows that share the browser menu bar. r=Jamie,mac-reviewers,bradwerth\n\nThe hidden window, whose menu bar macOS shows once no browser window is open, and the other windows that include macWindow.inc.xhtml build their native menus from their own copy of the browser's key elements. CustomKeys only updated browser windows, so a shortcut changed in about:keyboard did not work from those menu bars.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336501\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/nonbrowser-mac.js", "browser/components/customkeys/CustomKeys.sys.mjs", "browser/components/customkeys/tests/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/customkeys/tests/browser/browser_CustomKeys_macHiddenWindow.js"], "git_node": "190db23362eb948d31eb796a29d3f4e7c50924d6", "git_parents": ["ca007f7b32a32be5d5a017aa844bea28ee638ce1"], "node": "27a3b649140b006c91745127122bda8dfe7f3978", "parents": ["a1bd02adf0285688b6b19443f4d2a7a991c21571"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Jakobi \u003cajakobi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083366 - Check for null OverscollHandoffChain in ClearScrolledByHandedOffGestureOnChain. r=botond\n\nAdds a check for a null OverscrollHandoffChain in ClearScrolledByHandedOffGestureOnChain\nfor when the current input block has a null target.\n\nAdd a gtest that reproduces the crash caused by the missing null check.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337997\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/apz/src/AsyncPanZoomController.cpp", "gfx/layers/apz/test/gtest/TestPinching.cpp"], "git_node": "af9936217b2c51f179145f795b0588771f1d1001", "git_parents": ["190db23362eb948d31eb796a29d3f4e7c50924d6"], "node": "9ac811f42c450a96f17240e76614c39e8a7cc7a1", "parents": ["27a3b649140b006c91745127122bda8dfe7f3978"], "tags": []}, {"author": "James Teow \u003cjteow@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086893 - Avoid recompiling the frecency statements on every calculate_frecency call - r=mak,places-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: h