ronment; r=arai\n\nThis changes the wasm module environment creation to use the export names\nfrom the wasm module, and adds a new\njs::CreateEnvironmentShapeForWasmModule function.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334948\n", "files": ["js/src/builtin/ModuleObject.cpp", "js/src/builtin/ModuleObject.h", "js/src/vm/EnvironmentObject.cpp", "js/src/vm/EnvironmentObject.h", "js/src/vm/Modules.cpp", "js/src/vm/Scope.cpp", "js/src/vm/Scope.h"], "git_node": "d3dcaf7f8d7cf64ce520ed479908151a3cc932f9", "git_parents": ["1954afbc3c8ea6ac146417364a9f4fcda55aa9d7"], "node": "908e86160715b4f0bc17094f91e216088450d1c4", "parents": ["c0a4db826d9bb562a6766a337aacb0129851ba0f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Daniel Minor \u003cdminor@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2030454 - Replace isSourcePhaseModule with isWasmModule in ModuleObject; r=arai\n\nIt's likely that source phase will also be defined for JavaScript modules\nin the future. Checking for WebAssembly here explicitly is better.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334949\n", "files": ["js/src/builtin/ModuleObject.cpp", "js/src/builtin/ModuleObject.h", "js/src/vm/Modules.cpp"], "git_node": "82d4f18b09cbe625877e9d874ab88252897199b4", "git_parents": ["d3dcaf7f8d7cf64ce520ed479908151a3cc932f9"], "node": "77300b75d7c054d050294da55b6c3fd971508540", "parents": ["908e86160715b4f0bc17094f91e216088450d1c4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Daniel Minor \u003cdminor@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2030454 - Support wasm modules in ModuleGetExportedNames; r=arai\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334950\n", "files": ["js/src/vm/Modules.cpp"], "git_node": "c7e7957f62956b2cf32dc65127012ddb895f1f87", "git_parents": ["82d4f18b09cbe625877e9d874ab88252897199b4"], "node": "1c5fc658eadc164db580ec6170084fd64ef382bb", "parents": ["77300b75d7c054d050294da55b6c3fd971508540"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Daniel Minor \u003cdmi