36 - Skip style sharing for elements with mapped declarations. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,emilio\n\nMapped declaration blocks are per-element, including for HTML, and cannot pass the pointer-identity comparison used for presentation hints. Reject these elements during insertion and lookup alongside the other element eligibility checks. Read the mapped-attribute bits directly after checking that AttrArray holds an implementation pointer. Extra declarations inherited from tables or sources remain eligible for sharing.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338559\n", "files": ["servo/components/style/dom.rs", "servo/components/style/gecko/wrapper.rs", "servo/components/style/sharing/mod.rs"], "git_node": "4f95ed3e77c7bc459a9eb4fa07444f7728e556c5", "git_parents": ["87ffbdd141bdf0fc5216f94580c29ec780ce48a5"], "node": "c4ffba17ddfcf8636cad7d5906ca27150689e085", "parents": ["4d509aa2376f1e843968458c3de318922e01ee49"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Luca Greco \u003clgreco@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083782 - Add a Classic themes section to about:addons themes list view. r=dao,mstriemer,willdurand,fluent-reviewers,desktop-theme-reviewers,bolsson\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335181\n", "files": ["browser/locales/en-US/browser/appExtensionFields.ftl", "browser/themes/ThemesList.sys.mjs", "browser/themes/test/unit/test_ThemesList.js", "toolkit/locales/en-US/toolkit/about/aboutAddons.ftl", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/aboutaddons.css", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/aboutaddons.html", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/components/aboutaddons-themes-picker.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/components/aboutaddons-themes-pickers.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/components/addon-list.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/internal/ThemesBundledLocalization.sys.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/test/browser/browser_html_themes_picker.js"], "git_node": "8cd292ae28ffdffc580a14044e5d550cc9e7eb51", "git_parents": ["4f95ed3e77c7bc459a9eb4fa07444f7728e556c5"], "node": "f9255ea2ae0245b00940917eaeea40044a8f00a4", "parents": ["c4ffba17ddfcf8636cad7d5906ca27150689e085"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Luca Greco \u003clgreco@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083782 - Add Firefox OLED theme to Classic themes section. r=dao,mstriemer,fluent-reviewers,desktop-theme-reviewers,bolsson\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335571\n", "files": ["browser/locales/en-US/browser/appExtensionFields.ftl", "browser/themes/ThemesList.sys.mjs", "browser/themes/test/unit/test_ThemesList.js", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/internal/ThemesBundledLocalization.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "4e2b8a7c3c823569e8e3918fda010e6dbd1d34ea", "git_parents": ["8cd292ae28ffdffc580a14044e5d550cc9e7eb51"], "node": "4c71dbe4d3758f20da3c12556be0caffac6a5e2e", "parents": ["f9255ea2ae0245b00940917eaeea40044a8f00a4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2083782 - Add Firefox OLED theme to Classic themes section. r=dao,mstriemer,fluent-reviewers,desktop-theme-reviewers,bolsson\" for causing Linting failures.\n\nThis reverts commit 4e2b8a7c3c823569e8e3918fda010e6dbd1d34ea.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2083782 - Add a Classic themes section to about:addons themes list view. r=dao,mstriemer,willdurand,fluent-reviewers,desktop-theme-reviewers,bolsson\"\n\nThis reverts commit 8cd292ae28ffdffc580a14044e5d550cc9e7eb51.\n", "files": ["browser/locales/en-US/browser/appExtensionFields.ftl", "browser/themes/ThemesList.sys.mjs", "browser/themes/test/unit/test_ThemesList.js", "toolkit/locales/en-US/toolkit/about/aboutAddons.ftl", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/aboutaddons.css", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/aboutaddons.html", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/components/aboutaddons-themes-picker.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/components/aboutaddons-themes-pickers.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/components/addon-list.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/internal/ThemesBundledLocalization.sys.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/test/browser/browser_html_themes_picker.js"], "git_node": "d77eb42a789b300cbaa2eb977b57ddb0120648cf", "git_parents": ["4e2b8a7c3c823569e8e3918fda010e6dbd1d34ea"], "node": "73927f43db2c92872b4bd019129189ccbeaf76a1", "parents": ["4c71dbe4d3758f20da3c12556be0caffac6a5e2e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Updatebot \u003cupdatebot@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087844 - Update android nightly application-services version bump to 38dd8e08931ee1205a63fb47c39d660aaa179ef5 r=release-managers,dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338565\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/plugins/dependencies/src/main/java/ApplicationServices.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/plugins/dependencies/src/main/java/moz.yaml"], "git_node": "1796e3df7a0dc030c0a1db733e83fa10f0209cd3", "git_parents": ["d77eb42a789b300cbaa2eb977b57ddb0120648cf"], "node": "18c4cb445312c9d02c8286c4ce04c3e1aab5afe0", "parents": ["73927f43db2c92872b4bd019129189ccbeaf76a1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dre Grant \u003cdgrant@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079330 - Add an optional widget_variant key to widget events. r=maxx\n\nWidget events don\u2019t currently say what the widget was showing, so Privacy can\u2019t connect a message click to the message someone saw. This adds optional widget_variant to widgets_impression, widgets_user_event, widgets_enabled and widgets_error, through useWidgetTelemetry and TelemetryFeed. Other widgets keep recording the same events as before.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336901\n", "files": ["browser/components/newtab/metrics.yaml", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Widgets/useWidgetTelemetry.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/lib/TelemetryFeed.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/Widgets/useWidgetTelemetry.test.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/xpcshell/test_TelemetryFeed.js"], "git_node": "26bab340c749833266e62d3775547c871cec8ce6", "git_parents": ["1796e3df7a0dc030c0a1db733e83fa10f0209cd3"], "node": "1d64474ffcaf3a1d5c58c812d2b7db6d3957c8e5", "parents": ["18c4cb445312c9d02c8286c4ce04c3e1aab5afe0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dre Grant \u003cdgrant@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079330 - Record Privacy impressions with widget_variant and keep each tab\u2019s message after its impression. r=maxx\n\nPrivacy recorded impressions as `widgets_user_event`, inflating its interaction count. A new tab could also change the message in an open tab, causing clicks to be attributed to the wrong one. This records one `widgets_impression` with `widget_variant` set to `etp_off`, `no_trackers_blocked` or the message shown, and removes the two impression user events. Each tab keeps its message after the impression, while counts and the protection-off state continue to update so later events reflect what\u2019s on screen.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336902\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Widgets/Privacy/Privacy.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Widgets/useWidgetTelemetry.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/Widgets/Privacy.test.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/Widgets/useWidgetTelemetry.test.jsx"], "git_node": "8723101217a5dadaa9a6bd5a28f4067af67db703", "git_parents": ["26bab340c749833266e62d3775547c871cec8ce6"], "node": "cf3fe7a3a8699617f1d4c10918417551f29af3c1", "parents": ["1d64474ffcaf3a1d5c58c812d2b7db6d3957c8e5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Naz\u0131m Can Alt\u0131nova \u003ccanaltinova@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086709 - Clear the ReportingObserver buffered option after the first observe(). r=smaug\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337655\n", "files": ["dom/reporting/ReportingObserver.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/reporting/buffered-observe-again.html"], "git_node": "497685bd60f6079b3b4823cc32983bf997a8b23e", "git_parents": ["8723101217a5dadaa9a6bd5a28f4067af67db703"], "node": "bcbd3369dc9cf82bedbc993ca1cd6cdf01b43b9c", "parents": ["cf3fe7a3a8699617f1d4c10918417551f29af3c1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Naz\u0131m Can Alt\u0131nova \u003ccanaltinova@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087628 - Include the first-input entry in getEntries() and getEntriesByName(). r=bas\n\nThe first-input entry type has availableFromTimeline set to true in the registry:\nhttps://w3c.github.io/timing-entrytypes-registry/#registry\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338548\n", "files": ["dom/performance/PerformanceMainThread.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/event-timing/first-input-retrievable-from-timeline.html"], "git_node": "222fdffe8b4cf591504384d43ff2732b36ba9d9b", "git_parents": ["497685bd60f6079b3b4823cc32983bf997a8b23e"], "node": "1fec949ad60701de075867b719f9db8d910fce72", "parents": ["bcbd3369dc9cf82bedbc993ca1cd6cdf01b43b9c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Luca Greco \u003clgreco@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083782 - Add a Classic themes section to about:addons themes list view. r=dao,mstriemer,willdurand,fluent-reviewers,desktop-theme-reviewers,bolsson\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335181\n", "files": ["browser/locales/en-US/browser/appExtensionFields.ftl", "browser/themes/ThemesList.sys.mjs", "browser/themes/test/unit/test_ThemesList.js", "toolkit/locales/en-US/toolkit/about/aboutAddons.ftl", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/aboutaddons.css", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/aboutaddons.html", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/components/aboutaddons-themes-picker.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/components/aboutaddons-themes-pickers.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/components/addon-list.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/internal/ThemesBundledLocalization.sys.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/test/browser/browser_html_themes_picker.js"], "git_node": "4a733fe010afa2f7dbe8af40916e55d08bd3ff83", "git_parents": ["222fdffe8b4cf591504384d43ff2732b36ba9d9b"], "node": "8d73605cf925ee1b1ea8e06ff6d91b76c17b2299", "parents": ["1fec949ad60701de075867b719f9db8d910fce72"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Luca Greco \u003clgreco@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083782 - Add Firefox OLED theme to Classic themes section. r=dao,mstriemer,fluent-reviewers,desktop-theme-reviewers,bolsson\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335571\n", "files": ["browser/locales/en-US/browser/appExtensionFields.ftl", "browser/themes/ThemesList.sys.mjs", "browser/themes/test/unit/test_ThemesList.js", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/internal/ThemesBundledLocalization.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "e4841a6e649aec696028c88e1d4a3ba87163514e", "git_parents": ["4a733fe010afa2f7dbe8af40916e55d08bd3ff83"], "node": "88cf3ceef83967b1137855c0a4c6ef4deaf78c57", "parents": ["8d73605cf925ee1b1ea8e06ff6d91b76c17b2299"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 135040 - Track the image frame of an \u003carea\u003e in HTMLAreaElement. r=emilio,layout-reviewers\n\nAdd HTMLAreaElement::GetImageFrame, set up by nsImageMap, and\nnsLayoutUtils::GetPrimaryOrAreaImageFrame to look it up from any content.\nThe \u003carea\u003e still uses the image frame as its primary frame for now.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338560\n", "files": ["dom/html/HTMLAreaElement.h", "layout/base/nsLayoutUtils.cpp", "layout/base/nsLayoutUtils.h", "layout/generic/nsImageMap.cpp"], "git_node": "2db069e8bd697664b29a53fd4b494f766f91c6d3", "git_parents": ["e4841a6e649aec696028c88e1d4a3ba87163514e"], "node": "c605a7e3a3a4b9b9b93815bcb4f2f3bd107c354b", "parents": ["88cf3ceef83967b1137855c0a4c6ef4deaf78c57"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 135040 - Look up the image frame of an \u003carea\u003e via GetPrimaryOrAreaImageFrame. r=emilio,layout-reviewers\n\nPreparation for no longer making the image frame the primary frame of\n\u003carea\u003e elements: focus navigation, mouse capture, event dispatch and\naccessibility ask for the image frame explicitly.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338561\n", "files": ["accessible/base/FocusManager.cpp", "accessible/generic/DocAccessible.cpp", "accessible/generic/LocalAccessible.cpp", "accessible/html/HTMLImageMapAccessible.cpp", "dom/base/Selection.cpp", "dom/base/nsFocusManager.cpp", "dom/events/EventStateManager.cpp", "dom/events/PointerEventHandler.cpp", "layout/base/PresShell.cpp", "layout/base/nsPresContext.cpp", "layout/base/nsPresContext.h", "layout/generic/nsIFrame.cpp", "layout/generic/nsImageFrame.cpp"], "git_node": "7775e6714c5a806c3d01ff1c44f4edf9b0e83e80", "git_parents": ["2db069e8bd697664b29a53fd4b494f766f91c6d3"], "node": "83fe4135ec10f5d4081a36099cf3de0c75eee583", "parents": ["c605a7e3a3a4b9b9b93815bcb4f2f3bd107c354b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 135040 - Don't make the image frame the primary frame of \u003carea\u003e elements. r=emilio,layout-reviewers\n\nAreas have no frame of their own; the image frame is reachable through\nHTMLAreaElement::GetImageFrame. Remove the area special cases that\nworked around the shared mapping in nsIContent::SetPrimaryFrame and the\nfocus and accessibility code that relied on it.\n\nAs a result an \u003carea\u003e has an empty bounding client rect, as the spec\nrequires. This makes area-offsets.html pass, and\ntest_mousecapture_area.html now clicks the image instead of the area.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338562\n", "files": ["accessible/base/nsAccessibilityService.cpp", "dom/base/nsFocusManager.cpp", "dom/base/nsIContentInlines.h", "layout/base/PresShell.cpp", "layout/generic/nsImageMap.cpp", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/semantics/embedded-content/the-area-element/area-offsets.html.ini", "toolkit/content/tests/widgets/test_mousecapture_area.html"], "git_node": "78575996530a69056cb446b8070a0aad667587ac", "git_parents": ["7775e6714c5a806c3d01ff1c44f4edf9b0e83e80"], "node": "55db43b257ccb04f7494ac33f61fb647f99c2a74", "parents": ["83fe4135ec10f5d4081a36099cf3de0c75eee583"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 135040 - Remove workarounds for \u003carea\u003e sharing the image frame. r=emilio,firefox-style-system-reviewers,layout-reviewers\n\nNow that \u003carea\u003e has no primary frame, frame construction, restyling,\ncomputed style and top layer handling no longer need to special-case it.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338563\n", "files": ["layout/base/nsCSSFrameConstructor.cpp", "layout/generic/ViewportFrame.cpp", "layout/generic/nsImageFrame.cpp", "layout/style/RestyleManager.cpp", "layout/style/nsComputedDOMStyle.cpp", "layout/style/res/html.css"], "git_node": "8c02dbd6c314d2ec87d114865e976ecac962fa75", "git_parents": ["78575996530a69056cb446b8070a0aad667587ac"], "node": "65e041e06f84124b04f79624751c4fae6b863fba", "parents": ["55db43b257ccb04f7494ac33f61fb647f99c2a74"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Bumping Firefox l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD CLOSED TREE\n\nach -\u003e 59a1cd992fd770a82ae65bb7a63b4174d500d1e4\naf -\u003e 59a1cd992fd770a82ae65bb7a63b4174d500d1e4\nan -\u003e 59a1cd992fd770a82ae65bb7a63b4174d500d1e4\nar -\u003e 59a1cd992fd770a82ae65bb7a63b4174d500d1e4\nast -\u003e 59a1cd992fd770a82ae65bb7