.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086296 - Keep destroyed actors queued with deferred destroy commands in offscreen WebRender transactions. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338178\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/wr/WebRenderBridgeChild.cpp"], "git_node": "141096d7cd9e6f6118d94d79ea0c1777839efe9e", "git_parents": ["7da69462c2786d9a27a8f319ff4cda40df0e091b"], "node": "cb2c536c991c2869d2e0f3e7a882b26b494a4ad8", "parents": ["01acf59c7df85071cf1d0c369468fdcf7d5ffa79"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793568757, "git_changesets": ["ecd3f7a28f9a1116519490f88bd7fcf4a69c4cb2", "b7f5d674557ded6e746f36f6de3e20325cef903f", "87ffbdd141bdf0fc5216f94580c29ec780ce48a5", "4f95ed3e77c7bc459a9eb4fa07444f7728e556c5", "8cd292ae28ffdffc580a14044e5d550cc9e7eb51", "4e2b8a7c3c823569e8e3918fda010e6dbd1d34ea", "d77eb42a789b300cbaa2eb977b57ddb0120648cf", "1796e3df7a0dc030c0a1db733e83fa10f0209cd3", "26bab340c749833266e62d3775547c871cec8ce6", "8723101217a5dadaa9a6bd5a28f4067af67db703", "497685bd60f6079b3b4823cc32983bf997a8b23e", "222fdffe8b4cf591504384d43ff2732b36ba9d9b", "4a733fe010afa2f7dbe8af40916e55d08bd3ff83", "e4841a6e649aec696028c88e1d4a3ba87163514e", "2db069e8bd697664b29a53fd4b494f766f91c6d3", "7775e6714c5a806c3d01ff1c44f4edf9b0e83e80", "78575996530a69056cb446b8070a0aad667587ac", "8c02dbd6c314d2ec87d114865e976ecac962fa75", "c22b83bbc994eecc3e14ad33c716d19e5f20cf22", "7da69462c2786d9a27a8f319ff4cda40df0e091b", "141096d7cd9e6f6118d94d79ea0c1777839efe9e"], "user": "csabou@mozilla.com"}, "45690": {"changesets": [{"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087348 - Mint display list store uids from one counter per store set r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nEach store numbered its entries from zero, so a rectangle could take the uid of\na gradient or box shadow drawn in the same place. Tile dependencies and quad\ncache keys compare the uid without the primitive kind, and kept the old pixels.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338181\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/dl_interner.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/render_backend.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_builder_thread.rs"], "git_node": "ed22b64bf63d902c23ff3d838caf7d8a4b59edb0", "git_parents": ["141096d7cd9e6f6118d94d79ea0c1777839efe9e"], "node": "88eb937dd75e6fe4368477ee0f3bb6dc58b0df3e", "parents": ["cb2c536c991c2869d2e0f3e7a882b26b494a4ad8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Qu\u00e8ze \u003cflorian@queze.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086751 - Allow for real viewport scrollbars in test_viewport_scrollbar_causing_reflow.html, r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,emilio.\n\nThe harness gives the test iframe scrolling=\"no\" only when running several\ntests, so the scrollbar leeway was only ever checked with scrollbars that take\nno space. Run alone (the standalone variant, skipped since bug 2026600), real\nscrollbars appear and need more leeway: the counts in CI exceed the reference\nby 17 on Linux and macOS and by 25 on Windows. The larger leeway only applies\nwhen the scrollbars take space, so chunked runs keep the old margin.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337702\n", "files": ["layout/style/test/mochitest.toml", "layout/style/test/test_viewport_scrollbar_causing_reflow.html"], "git_node": "c8dd105f2af80c5ee0d816ed83e25840f0d149d5", "git_parents": ["ed22b64bf63d902c23ff3d838caf7d8a4b59edb0"], "node": "42178a2f518b70fd6356af086c726d74c9897eb1", "parents": ["88eb937dd75e6fe4368477ee0f3bb6dc58b0df3e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-central repo-update remote-settings tld-suffixes ct-logs r=release-managers,RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338610\n", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/ct/CTKnownLogs.h", "security/manager/tools/log_list.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": "cde539e0ab73a44f7b41832cd5aca4bf1f527eb0", "git_parents": ["c8dd105f2af80c5ee0d816ed83e25840f0d149d5"], "node": "d80f5171f8a02f392a4e16c703e9526d265cebd8", "parents": ["42178a2f518b70fd6356af086c726d74c9897eb1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084403 - Intern images in the display list builder r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\npush_image now collapses repeated axes and takes the visible sub-rect itself,\nso the key is built against the rect the primitive gets. A foreign image key\nresolves to ImageKey::DUMMY and draws nothing, where the scene builder used to\ndrop the item.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337773\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/dl_interner.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/intern.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prepare.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/image.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/interned.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/render_backend.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_builder_thread.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_building.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_debug.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender_api/src/display_item.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender_api/src/display_list.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender_api/src/interning.rs", "gfx/wr/wrshell/src/wrench.rs"], "git_node": "b4fca9cf86b71d2c5ca1f06447f6e150a7ea0e1a", "git_parents": ["cde539e0ab73a44f7b41832cd5aca4bf1f527eb0"], "node": "08d8eb9ea05c4f57e6d4f7c4a6c7ae4d38d53ef5", "parents": ["d80f5171f8a02f392a4e16c703e9526d265cebd8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephen A Pohl \u003cspohl@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053597: Size the canvas drag image from its snapshot and clamp the GTK pixbuf read. r=stransky,gtk-reviewers\n\nnsBaseDragSession::DrawDragForImage sized the drag rect for a canvas from the element's width/height content attributes (aCanvas-\u003eGetSize()) while taking the drag-image surface from aCanvas-\u003eGetSurfaceSnapshot(). For a canvas transferred to an OffscreenCanvas the snapshot is the offscreen front buffer, whose dimensions are independent of the element attributes, so the two could disagree and the platform drag-image code received a mismatched rect/surface pair.\n\nSize the drag rect from the snapshot surface instead, so the rect and surface are always consistent. For a regular canvas this is unchanged because the snapshot already matches the element size. The image branch already renders into a rect-sized target, so it was consistent by construction. The two branches no longer share the rect and the emptiness check, so that each one checks the size it ends up using: the image branch its requested rect, the canvas branch its snapshot.\n\nAlso harden the GTK sink: nsImageToPixbuf::SourceSurfaceToPixbuf copied aWidth x aHeight pixels straight out of the mapped source surface in its native-format fast path, guarded only by a debug-only assertion that compiled out in release builds. Clamp the copy region to the mapped surface size and zero the uncovered pixels of the destination pixbuf, so an oversized request can never read out of bounds regardless of the caller. The macOS and Windows sinks already sample the surface into a rect-sized buffer with clamping and were not affected.\n\nAdds a gtest that exercises an oversized request against a small source surface.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311447\n", "files": ["widget/gtk/nsImageToPixbuf.cpp", "widget/nsBaseDragService.cpp", "widget/tests/gtest/TestSourceSurfaceToPixbuf.cpp", "widget/tests/gtest/moz.build"], "git_node": "efe166a4ecaecd9b26891898f60846f080654582", "git_parents": ["b4fca9cf86b71d2c5ca1f06447f6e150a7ea0e1a"], "node": "2e9702b05be006596850035f24a3ce47497afd3a", "parents": ["08d8eb9ea05c4f57e6d4f7c4a6c7ae4d38d53ef5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephen A Pohl \u003cspohl@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053597: Use the offscreen bitmap size for canvas placeholders. r=emilio,firefox-style-system-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322618\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/OffscreenCanvasDisplayHelper.cpp", "dom/canvas/OffscreenCanvasDisplayHelper.h", "dom/html/HTMLCanvasElement.cpp", "dom/html/HTMLCanvasElement.h", "layout/style/MappedDeclarationsBuilder.h", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/offscreen/manual/the-offscreen-canvas/offscreencanvas.placeholder.size.html"], "git_node": "7f9e1ecd5d62c1a163652a55c1db10c9183f43c8", "git_parents": ["efe166a4ecaecd9b26891898f60846f080654582"], "node": "76a3d3ef3148dbc4d157d812a50b08077b85d534", "parents": ["2e9702b05be006596850035f24a3ce47497afd3a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephen A Pohl \u003cspohl@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083981: Count only disabled maintenance service preferences in update telemetry. r=yjuglaret,application-update-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335853\n", "files": ["toolkit/mozapps/update/UpdateService.sys.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/update/UpdateTelemetry.sys.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/update/tests/unit_aus_update/servicePrefTelemetry.js", "toolkit/mozapps/update/tests/unit_aus_update/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "70fec7142476b4f46b58928920a84c0332874fcb", "git_parents": ["7f9e1ecd5d62c1a163652a55c1db10c9183f43c8"], "node": "bfc80cf59e63009780dcf0414d0a28f61cda1fc4", "parents": ["76a3d3ef3148dbc4d157d812a50b08077b85d534"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephen A Pohl \u003cspohl@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2085990: Use NIGHTLY_BUILD for Mac startup run loop diagnostics. r=emilio,crashreporting-reviewers,gsvelto\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337010\n", "files": ["toolkit/crashreporter/CrashAnnotations.yaml", "toolkit/xre/MacApplicationDelegate.mm"], "git_node": "36eb09daa693fc245b1ce4e3ae70962b6cba3a4a", "git_parents": ["70fec7142476b4f46b58928920a84c0332874fcb"], "node": "15778653a1de7a322d745142a3e551ab374ced2b", "parents": ["bfc80cf59e63009780dcf0414d0a28f61cda1fc4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "agoloman \u003cagoloman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2053597: Size the canvas drag image from its snapshot and clamp the GTK pixbuf read. r=stransky,gtk-reviewers\" for causing build bustages @OffscreenCanvasDisplayHelper.h.\n\nThis reverts commit efe166a4ecaecd9b26891898f60846f080654582.\n", "files": ["widget/gtk/nsImageToPixbuf.cpp", "widget/nsBaseDragService.cpp", "widget/tests/gtest/TestSourceSurfaceToPixbuf.cpp", "widget/tests/gtest/moz.build"], "git_node": "cd7c66e384af2272e7eda6136711e05e43366756", "git_parents": ["36eb09daa693fc245b1ce4e3ae70962b6cba3a4a"], "node": "4acb9de3af3a372ef1d89beb50f6f83234dbcd5a", "parents": ["15778653a1de7a322d745142a3e551ab374ced2b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "agoloman \u003cagoloman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2053597: Use the offscreen bitmap size for canvas placeholders. r=emilio,firefox-style-system-reviewers\" for causing build bustages @OffscreenCanvasDisplayHelper.h.\n\nThis reverts commit 7f9e1ecd5d62c1a163652a55c1db10c9183f43c8.\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/OffscreenCanvasDisplayHelper.cpp", "dom/canvas/OffscreenCanvasDisplayHelper.h", "dom/html/HTMLCanvasElement.cpp", "dom/html/HTMLCanvasElement.h", "layout/style/MappedDeclarationsBuilder.h", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/offscreen/manual/the-offscreen-canvas/offscreencanvas.placeholder.size.html"], "git_node": "48eb60989c0dc58e44982ee9c270acf8ac3c6627", "git_parents": ["cd7c66e384af2272e7eda6136711e05e43366756"], "node": "bf1f6cb8282cc68df38bf8918c69d04871fbfe24", "parents": ["4acb9de3af3a372ef1d89beb50f6f83234dbcd5a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephen A Pohl \u003cspohl@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053597: Size the canvas drag image from its snapshot and clamp the GTK pixbuf read. r=stransky,gtk-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311447\n", "files": ["widget/gtk/nsImageToPixbuf.cpp", "widget/nsBaseDragService.cpp", "widget/tests/gtest/TestSourceSurfaceToPixbuf.cpp", "widget/tests/gtest/moz.build"], "git_node": "ccea4e8fe5b4daa58c86798e60f0b824ab0220ac", "git_parents": ["48eb60989c0dc58e44982ee9c270acf8ac3c6627"], "node": "377dbec6bf44f649740418a926130400aa0324ad", "parents": ["bf1f6cb8282cc68df38bf8918c69d04871fbfe24"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephen A Pohl \u003cspohl@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053597: Use the offscreen bitmap size for canvas placeholders. r=emilio,firefox-style-system-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322618\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/OffscreenCanvasDisplayHelper.cpp", "dom/canvas/OffscreenCanvasDisplayHelper.h", "dom/html/HTMLCanvasElement.cpp", "dom/html/HTMLCanvasElement.h", "layout/style/MappedDeclarationsBuilder.h", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/offscreen/manual/the-offscreen-canvas/offscreencanvas.placeholder.size.html"], "git_node": "d2e4ef3db058550d5fd8e0fa0396bfa2e43efa1a", "git_parents": ["ccea4e8fe5b4daa58c86798e60f0b824ab0220ac"], "node": "21a633c08544d3f20125e8ab5f9c9386588d1784", "parents": ["377dbec6bf44f649740418a926130400aa0324ad"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084404 - Intern yuv images in the display list builder r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nThe padded plane list and format come from the YuvData at push time. If any\nplane's key is foreign, all three resolve to ImageKey::DUMMY.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337774\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/dl_interner.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/intern.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prepare.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/image.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/interned.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/render_backend.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_builder_thread.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_building.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_debug.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender_api/src/display_item.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender_api/src/display_list.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender_api/src/interning.rs"], "git_node": "04a2997f3eac0089ce8432504930cc9a649cc021", "git_parents": ["d2e4ef3db058550d5fd8e0fa0396bfa2e43efa1a"], "node": "d6881491c1e5a374dbf68bfc0f8a809f680eb258", "parents": ["21a633c08544d3f20125e8ab5f9c9386588d1784"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 7915 - Add a WPT reftest for changing an iframe's scrolling attribute from yes to no. r=layout-reviewers,emilio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338514\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/semantics/embedded-content/the-iframe-element/iframe-modify-scrolling-attr-to-no-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/semantics/embedded-content/the-iframe-element/iframe-modify-scrolling-attr-to-no.html"], "git_node": "4bde0ccd695ba453474ea47836a098cb4309f38c", "git_parents": ["04a2997f3eac0089ce8432504930cc9a649cc021"], "node": "32c2abd06903d231694f56028f057622256cdfa8", "parents": ["d6881491c1e5a374dbf68bfc0f8a809f680eb258"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rob Wu \u003crob@robwu.nl\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067732 - Add pending extension updates to BrowserState r=android-reviewers,marcin\n\nExtension updates that need new permissions will wait for the user instead of\nbeing denied behind a system notification. This adds the state for them,\nwhich will be populated later in this patch stack.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334270\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/state/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/state/action/BrowserAction.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/state/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/state/reducer/WebExtensionReducer.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/state/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/state/selector/Selectors.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/state/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/state/state/BrowserState.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/state/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/state/state/extension/PendingExtensionUpdate.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/state/src/test/java/mozilla/components/browser/state/action/WebExtensionActionTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/state/src/test/java/mozilla/components/browser/state/selector/SelectorsKtTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/state/src/test/java/mozilla/components/browser/state/state/extension/PendingExtensionUpdateTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/support/webextensions/src/main/java/mozilla/components/support/webextensions/WebExtensionSupport.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/support/webextensions/src/test/java/mozilla/components/support/webextensions/WebExtensionSupportTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/docs/changelog.md"], "git_node": "f2fbec53c5fa4769d23a59ce8ddf710cf5244e21", "git_parents": ["4bde0ccd695ba453474ea47836a098cb4309f38c"], "node": "e60f4b85f03f6afef1dd876a9a7ab9a95f09b3f8", "parents": ["32c2abd06903d231694f56028f057622256cdfa8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rob Wu \u003crob@robwu.nl\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067732 - Look up extension permission prompt requests by ID r=android-reviewers,marcin\n\nThis enables a recreated prompt to identify the correct (original)\nrequest instead of whatever the current request is.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334271\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/state/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/state/state/extension/WebExtensionPromptRequest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/ui/PermissionsDialogFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/extension/WebExtensionPromptFeature.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/extension/WebExtensionPromptFeatureTest.kt"], "git_node": "11adb719ffd66aa3c410edfd0988c7bc0a8028d3", "git_parents": ["f2fbec53c5fa4769d23a59ce8ddf710cf5244e21"], "node": "69ad1e2ff880ecbb45830af3f486287e5404609b", "parents": ["e60f4b85f03f6afef1dd876a9a7ab9a95f09b3f8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rob Wu \u003crob@robwu.nl\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067732 - Add an update mode to PermissionsDialogFragment r=android-reviewers,android-l10n-reviewers,parker,marcin\n\nReplace the forOptionalPermissions flag with PermissionsDialogMode and\nexpand its functionality to not only support install dialogs and\noptional permissions, but also extension updates with new permissions.\n\nThis will be documented in the changelog later, when it is integrated in\nthe app in the \"Replace notification-based permission prompt\" part of\nthis patch stack.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334272\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/ui/PermissionsDialogFragment.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/res/layout/mozac_feature_addons_fragment_dialog_addon_permissions.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/res/values/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/ui/PermissionsDialogFragmentTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/extension/WebExtensionPromptFeature.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/extension/WebExtensionPromptFeatureTest.kt"], "git_node": "660a00ca3be2d7f98c8493e2127caf1313fc0c3a", "git_parents": ["11adb719ffd66aa3c410edfd0988c7bc0a8028d3"], "node": "ec77575b5123ea119fe8ed985748ee9cd8bdf0cc", "parents": ["69ad1e2ff880ecbb45830af3f486287e5404609b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rob Wu \u003crob@robwu.nl\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067732 - Show extension updates waiting for review on the extension screens r=android-reviewers,android-l10n-reviewers,parker,android-build-system-reviewers,RyanVM,marcin\n\nAdds a banner when an extension update requires new permissions, to the\nExtensions list, an extension's details and its \"Permissions and data\"\nscreen. The banner disappears when the user presses x or after an app\nrestart, and can return at the next add-on update check.\n\nThe \"Review changes\" button in the banner opens the update prompt that\nwas implemented in the previous commit.\n\nThese banners are not visible in the app yet because nothing populates\nthe set of pending updates. That will be done later in the patch stack,\nwith \"Replace notification-based permission prompt\". That will also\nadd the changelog entry for this API change.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334273\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/.buildconfig.yml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/state/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/state/action/BrowserAction.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/state/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/state/reducer/WebExtensionReducer.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/state/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/state/state/BrowserState.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/state/src/test/java/mozilla/components/browser/state/action/WebExtensionActionTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/build.gradle", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/ui/AddonsManagerAdapter.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/ui/AddonsManagerAdapterDelegate.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/ui/CustomViewHolder.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/ui/PendingExtensionUpdateBanner.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/res/layout/mozac_feature_addons_message_bars.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/res/values/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/ui/AddonsManagerAdapterTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/AddonPermissionsDetailsFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/AddonsManagementFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/AddonsManagementView.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/ExtensionUpdatePrompt.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/InstalledAddonDetailsFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/ui/AddonPermissionsScreen.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/extension/WebExtensionPromptFeature.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/AddonsManagementViewTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/ExtensionUpdatePromptTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/InstalledAddonDetailsFragmentTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/extension/WebExtensionPromptFeatureTest.kt"], "git_node": "4afbf420d0d26988cd88e53a074a73b9016d85d6", "git_parents": ["660a00ca3be2d7f98c8493e2127caf1313fc0c3a"], "node": "f7545d56c5547db53911e57385ad4ba217dcdecd", "parents": ["ec77575b5123ea119fe8ed985748ee9cd8bdf0cc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rob Wu \u003crob@robwu.nl\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067732 - Mention extension updates waiting for review in the app menu r=android-reviewers,android-l10n-reviewers,parker,petru\n\nAdds red \"Review update for [extension names]\" to the main Extensions\nmenu item in the app menu (current one and upcoming customizable menu),\nand \"Review settings to update\" to individual extension menu items\n(i.e. for enabled extensions with a browser action / page action).\n\nThis only adds an extra description without changing the behavior of the\nmenu items.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334274\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/ExtensionsMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuDialogFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/compose/ExtensionsMenuItem.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/compose/MainMenu.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/compose/MenuItem.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/ExtensionsMenuItemProviderTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuDialogFragmentTest.kt"], "git_node": "7699914f23ed730bc56cd863d174f2f97d7f0992", "git_parents": ["4afbf420d0d26988cd88e53a074a73b9016d85d6"], "node": "eb1e309d38e89a444ea0288ee9ef6567f589849a", "parents": ["f7545d56c5547db53911e57385ad4ba217dcdecd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rob Wu \u003crob@robwu.nl\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067732 - Show a dot on the menu button while an extension update waits for review r=android-reviewers,marcin\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334275\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/HomeActivity.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/bindings/PendingExtensionUpdateBinding.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/appstate/SupportedMenuNotifications.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/bindings/PendingExtensionUpdateBindingTest.kt"], "git_node": "4b3b647db813f5d1488c3b6ecafc38302e4bda05", "git_parents": ["7699914f23ed730bc56cd863d174f2f97d7f0992"], "node": "db78e369c10905e28738dd50e64ea9e99fc37721", "parents": ["eb1e309d38e89a444ea0288ee9ef6567f589849a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rob Wu \u003crob@robwu.nl\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067732 - Replace notification-based permission prompt with new in-app UI r=android-reviewers,marcin\n\nDefaultAddonUpdater used to deny an update that needs new permissions and post\na system notification; accepting it ran a new update check. Now it leaves the\nrequest unanswered and records it in BrowserState.pendingExtensionUpdates,\nwhere the screens from the previous commits show it. Accepting installs the\nversion that was already downloaded.\n\nThis adds the feature-addons changelog entry, which also covers the earlier\ncommits of this series.\n\nsamples-browser gets a minimal prompt, because AddonsManagerAdapter shows these\nupdates there too.\n\nThe notification code is now unused; the next commit will remove it.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334276\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/AddonManager.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/update/AddonUpdater.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/update/AddonUpdaterWorkerTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/update/DefaultAddonUpdaterTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/docs/changelog.md", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/browser/src/main/java/org/mozilla/samples/browser/DefaultComponents.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/browser/src/main/java/org/mozilla/samples/browser/addons/AddonsFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/Components.kt"], "git_node": "0403744452a2abe2704effc587e6808c48e99c57", "git_parents": ["4b3b647db813f5d1488c3b6ecafc38302e4bda05"], "node": "252dd626b886d45f3cd0758442d4cdd5df0938bf", "parents": ["db78e369c10905e28738dd50e64ea9e99fc37721"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rob Wu \u003crob@robwu.nl\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067732 - Remove the old extension update notification r=android-reviewers,android-l10n-reviewers,parker,marcin\n\nRemove NotificationHandlerService, UpdateStatusStorage and the code that built\nthe notification, remove its strings, and drop feature-addons'\nPOST_NOTIFICATIONS permission (support-base still declares it).\n\nDefaultAddonUpdater now deletes the old notification channel and\nUpdateStatusStorage's preferences file, so upgrading users don't keep a\nchannel, or a notification, that no longer works.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334277\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/update/AddonUpdater.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/res/values/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/update/DefaultAddonUpdaterTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/update/NotificationHandlerServiceTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/update/UpdateStatusStorageTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/docs/changelog.md"], "git_node": "940160ad54046ff856065e0f19f986cfefc7399d", "git_parents": ["0403744452a2abe2704effc587e6808c48e99c57"], "node": "8ed816abeebbda245635b2d845f37ce6cf466a95", "parents": ["252dd626b886d45f3cd0758442d4cdd5df0938bf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rob Wu \u003crob@robwu.nl\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067732 - Remove unused update-only permission strings r=android-reviewers,android-l10n-reviewers,parker,marcin\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334278\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/addons/Addon.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/res/values/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/test/java/AddonTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/docs/changelog.md"], "git_node": "a6825458f1b46294c0b943c62790a95c5b1f285c", "git_parents": ["940160ad54046ff856065e0f19f986cfefc7399d"], "node": "3897515b74e0a0b1e60e9a3b4d1cfba747e81a3f", "parents": ["8ed816abeebbda245635b2d845f37ce6cf466a95"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084809 - Part 2: Restore the MatchCardHeader with a competition label and match status badges r=android-reviewers,android-l10n-reviewers,parker,skhan\n\n- Restore MatchCardHeader, SportCardData and the preview fakes from the removed Homepage Sports Widget\n- Add Delayed, Suspended and Postponed match statuses with a neutral status badge next to the live badge\n\nFigma:\n- Live: https://www.figma.com/design/kDvQ8Hd2c5MwN9S3Y2FZ5r/Wrexham-Ideas?node-id=751-151478&m=dev\n- https://www.figma.com/design/kDvQ8Hd2c5MwN9S3Y2FZ5r/Wrexham-Ideas?node-id=751-151856&m=dev\n- No status: https://www.figma.com/design/kDvQ8Hd2c5MwN9S3Y2FZ5r/Wrexham-Ideas?node-id=751-152009&m=dev\n- Delayed: https://www.figma.com/design/kDvQ8Hd2c5MwN9S3Y2FZ5r/Wrexham-Ideas?node-id=751-152557&m=dev\n- Suspended: https://www.figma.com/design/kDvQ8Hd2c5MwN9S3Y2FZ5r/Wrexham-Ideas?node-id=751-152635&m=dev\n- Postponed: https://www.figma.com/design/kDvQ8Hd2c5MwN9S3Y2FZ5r/Wrexham-Ideas?node-id=751-152711&m=dev\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337002\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/sports/SportCardData.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/sports/fake/FakeSportsPreview.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/sports/ui/MatchCardHeader.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/sports/ui/MatchStatusBadge.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml"], "git_node": "9375d29fd241dcb3027a53c7894fc2066a506871", "git_parents": ["a6825458f1b46294c0b943c62790a95c5b1f285c"], "node": "6e52b4236754db68100d6e8f101236680da552ba", "parents": ["3897515b74e0a0b1e60e9a3b4d1cfba747e81a3f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084809 - Part 3: Restore the SportsWidgetMenu with the Wrexham widget menu items r=android-reviewers,android-l10n-reviewers,parker,skhan\n\n- Restore SportsWidgetMenu from the removed Homepage Sports Widget\n- Add Results, Standings, Wallpapers, Share and Remove Widget menu items with leading icons\n- Add a Compose preview for the menu\n\nFigma: https://www.figma.com/design/kDvQ8Hd2c5MwN9S3Y2FZ5r/Wrexham-Ideas?node-id=569-726050&m=dev\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337003\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/sports/ui/SportWidgetMenu.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml"], "git_node": "27cd8341dcf57e81a2d6f6dcab26bfeb3edcdaaf", "git_parents": ["9375d29fd241dcb3027a53c7894fc2066a506871"], "node": "37e78a247461ca0703efb0eeb201116f0ef6d400", "parents": ["6e52b4236754db68100d6e8f101236680da552ba"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084809 - Part 4: Add the SportsWidgetHeader with the team name and overflow menu r=android-reviewers,android-l10n-reviewers,parker,skhan\n\n- Add SportsWidgetHeader with the team crest and name and the SportsWidgetMenu overflow menu\n\nFigma: https://www.figma.com/design/kDvQ8Hd2c5MwN9S3Y2FZ5r/Wrexham-Ideas?node-id=751-150552&m=dev\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337004\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/sports/ui/SportsWidgetHeader.kt"], "git_node": "405c3df964edc57a8263a14ba10765e803c27120", "git_parents": ["27cd8341dcf57e81a2d6f6dcab26bfeb3edcdaaf"], "node": "5f3b9f977735f6da57573296cccc92a085ff8a21", "parents": ["37e78a247461ca0703efb0eeb201116f0ef6d400"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087360 - Part 1: Remove the push/pop reference frame display items. r=gfx-reviewers,bradwerth\n\nReference frames are fully described by their spatial tree item, which scene\nbuilding processes before any display item. The push/pop items only opened a\nbuild context that did nothing, so reference frames become plain definitions.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338190\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/wr/AsyncImagePipelineManager.cpp", "gfx/layers/wr/StackingContextHelper.cpp", "gfx/webrender_bindings/WebRenderAPI.cpp", "gfx/webrender_bindings/WebRenderAPI.h", "gfx/webrender_bindings/src/bindings.rs", "gfx/wr/examples/animation.rs", "gfx/wr/examples/iframe.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_building.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender_api/src/display_item.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender_api/src/display_list.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/src/yaml_frame_reader.rs", "gfx/wr/wrshell/src/wrench.rs", "layout/svg/SVGTextFrame.cpp"], "git_node": "83f09db478ea3d4964f552ca9ef362b288e38478", "git_parents": ["405c3df964edc57a8263a14ba10765e803c27120"], "node": "8b60eeb443889e000022865464582124777405c3", "parents": ["5f3b9f977735f6da57573296cccc92a085ff8a21"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087360 - Part 2: Define reference frames separately from stacking contexts. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nReference frames were created implicitly when pushing a stacking context, from\nstacking context parameters. They are now defined explicitly by the code that\nneeds them, and the stacking context is put in the resulting spatial node. All\nreference frames created for a frame go through\nWebRenderCommandBuilder::DefineReferenceFrame, keyed by the frame and the kind\nof reference frame, so that they can later be authored before display list\nbuilding.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338191\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/wr/AsyncImagePipelineManager.cpp", "gfx/layers/wr/StackingContextHelper.cpp", "gfx/layers/wr/StackingContextHelper.h", "gfx/layers/wr/WebRenderCommandBuilder.cpp", "gfx/layers/wr/WebRenderCommandBuilder.h", "gfx/webrender_bindings/WebRenderAPI.cpp", "gfx/webrender_bindings/WebRenderAPI.h", "gfx/webrender_bindings/src/bindings.rs", "layout/painting/nsDisplayList.cpp", "layout/svg/SVGTextFrame.cpp"], "git_node": "90efd8a997e1bb6f260404ef27f92d07ad82e2cb", "git_parents": ["83f09db478ea3d4964f552ca9ef362b288e38478"], "node": "625d0f6e848f0e1f62c26bcc8edc0fcd0cea3e55", "parents": ["8b60eeb443889e000022865464582124777405c3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Import translations from https://github.com/mozilla-l10n/android-l10n CLOSED TREE\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-bqi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-dsb/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-fi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-hr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-hsb/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-ja/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-kk/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-km/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-nn-rNO/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-sl/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-hr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-ja/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-kk/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-sl/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/media/src/main/res/values-sc/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/longfox/src/main/res/values-km/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-bqi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-brh/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-dsb/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-fi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-hr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ja/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-kk/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-km/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-nn-rNO/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-sl/strings.xml"], "git_node": "412f47ad0022356e64b5aad158703d227a016952", "git_parents": ["90efd8a997e1bb6f260404ef27f92d07ad82e2cb"], "node": "d00ca89a329871148aaf58d2b7db4eefe012f657", "parents": ["625d0f6e848f0e1f62c26bcc8edc0fcd0cea3e55"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Daniel Holbert \u003cdholbert@cs.stanford.edu\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056406: Add some \"FAIL\" text to an 'image-animation' WPT, to prevent the test from intermittently passing in browsers that don't support the feature.  r=TYLin\n\nThe test is using the 'image-animation' property to attempt to freeze an\nanimated image on its first frame.\n\nBefore this patch, the test *intermittently passes* in Firefox despite\n`image-animation` being unsupported.  In particular, it passes if the reftest\nscreenshot happens to be taken at the moment that the animated image's first\nframe is still showing.\n\nThis patch makes the test *reliably fail* in browsers that lack support for the\nfeature by adding some \"FAIL\" text (which then gets hidden in a @supports\ncondition so as not to impact the rendering in browsers that support the\nfeature).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338388\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-image-animation/image-animation-img-running-to-normal.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-image-animation/image-animation-img-running-to-normal.html"], "git_node": "dde622d48e638a519db1f3753302dd4756a88052", "git_parents": ["412f47ad0022356e64b5aad158703d227a016952"], "node": "7a9b9691290f62785b320e079da38a4ad775f9ca", "parents": ["d00ca89a329871148aaf58d2b7db4eefe012f657"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087786 - Vendor application-services 38dd8e08. r=markh\n\nDone via:\n\n    ./mach vendor third_party/application-services/moz.yaml -r 38dd8e08931ee1205a63fb47c39d660aaa179ef5\n    ./mach uniffi generate\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338535\n", "files": ["docs/rust-components/api/js/sync15.md", "third_party/application-services/build-scripts/component-common.gradle", "third_party/application-services/components/ads-client/integration-tests/tests/http_cache.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/ads-client/src/ads.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/ads-client/src/ads_store/store.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/ads-client/src/client.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/ads-client/src/http_cache.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/ads-client/src/http_cache/builder.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/ads-client/src/mars.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/ads-client/src/mars/ad_response.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/ads-client/src/telemetry.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/ads-client/src/telemetry/backend.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/ads-client/src/test_utils.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/sync15/src/client/sync_multiple.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/sync15/src/clients_engine/engine.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/sync15/src/clients_engine/mod.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/sync15/src/engine_choices.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/sync15/src/lib.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/sync_manager/src/manager.rs", "third_party/application-services/components/sync_manager/src/types.rs", "third_party/application-services/megazords/full/android/build.gradle", "third_party/application-services/moz.yaml", "third_party/application-services/testing/sync-test/src/auth.rs", "toolkit/components/uniffi-bindgen-gecko-js/android/components/sync15/android/src/main/java/mozilla/appservices/sync15/sync15.kt", "toolkit/components/uniffi-bindgen-gecko-js/android/components/syncmanager/android/src/main/java/mozilla/appservices/syncmanager/syncmanager.kt", "toolkit/components/uniffi-bindgen-gecko-js/components/generated/RustSync15.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/uniffi-js/GeneratedScaffolding.cpp"], "git_node": "424c0c31a873ae402715f1a2484c00e075120cd2", "git_parents": ["dde622d48e638a519db1f3753302dd4756a88052"], "node": "da783ebaca61a9fc9c83a7763d734ff5a5ca43b9", "parents": ["7a9b9691290f62785b320e079da38a4ad775f9ca"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087923. Render backdrop filters inside snapshotted stacking contexts. r=gfx-reviewers,gw\n\nA backdrop-filter chain is only prepared if a primitive drawing its output\nmarks it as required, and only the tile cache visibility pass did that.\nSnapshotted pictures get their visibility pass without a tile cache, so a\nbackdrop filter inside one was never drawn, neither into the snapshot nor on\nscreen. This drops backdrop filters from view transition snapshots.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338635\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/visibility.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/image/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/image/snapshot-backdrop-filter-ref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/image/snapshot-backdrop-filter.yaml", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/backdrop-filter-in-root-old-snapshot-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/backdrop-filter-in-root-old-snapshot.html"], "git_node": "964cfcc86d10e7134921f9183b3773c58551b552", "git_parents": ["424c0c31a873ae402715f1a2484c00e075120cd2"], "node": "fbf6c65584cd16c26c3c7e0acb14c7059db9d155", "parents": ["da783ebaca61a9fc9c83a7763d734ff5a5ca43b9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058058 - Stop enabling Sync bookmarks and passwords validation in early Beta. r=markh\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338616\n", "files": ["modules/libpref/init/all.js"], "git_node": "28b7a7bffb5f82828143d9ad63839ad263b598be", "git_parents": ["964cfcc86d10e7134921f9183b3773c58551b552"], "node": "61d640c1e032fc5806189da57fa5a56c722bbdb3", "parents": ["fbf6c65584cd16c26c3c7e0acb14c7059db9d155"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793612382, "git_changesets": ["ed22b64bf63d902c23ff3d838caf7d8a4b59edb0", "c8dd105f2af80c5ee0d816ed83e25840f0d149d5", "cde539e0ab73a44f7b41832cd5aca4bf1f527eb0", "b4fca9cf86b71d2c5ca1f06447f6e150a7ea0e1a", "efe166a4ecaecd9b26891898f60846f080654582", "7f9e1ecd5d62c1a163652a55c1db10c9183f43c8", "70fec7142476b4f46b58928920a84c0332874fcb", "36eb09daa693fc245b1ce4e3ae70962b6cba3a4a", "cd7c66e384af2272e7eda6136711e05e43366756", "48eb60989c0dc58e44982ee9c270acf8ac3c6627", "ccea4e8fe5b4daa58c86798e60f0b824ab0220ac", "d2e4ef3db058550d5fd8e0fa0396bfa2e43efa1a", "04a2997f3eac0089ce8432504930cc9a649cc021", "4bde0ccd695ba453474ea47836a098cb4309f38c", "f2fbec53c5fa4769d23a59ce8ddf710cf5244e21", "11adb719ffd66aa3c410edfd0988c7bc0a8028d3", "660a00ca3be2d7f98c8493e2127caf1313fc0c3a", "4afbf420d0d26988cd88e53a074a73b9016d85d6", "7699914f23ed730bc56cd863d174f2f97d7f0992", "4b3b647db813f5d1488c3b6ecafc38302e4bda05", "0403744452a2abe2704effc587e6808c48e99c57", "940160ad54046ff856065e0f19f986cfefc7399d", "a6825458f1b46294c0b943c62790a95c5b1f285c", "9375d29fd241dcb3027a53c7894fc2066a506871", "27cd8341dcf57e81a2d6f6dcab26bfeb3edcdaaf", "405c3df964edc57a8263a14ba10765e803c27120", "83f09db478ea3d4964f552ca9ef362b288e38478", "90efd8a997e1bb6f260404ef27f92d07ad82e2cb", "412f47ad0022356e64b5aad158703d227a016952", "dde622d48e638a519db1f3753302dd4756a88052", "424c0c31a873ae402715f1a2484c00e075120cd2", "964cfcc86d10e7134921f9183b3773c58551b552", "28b7a7bffb5f82828143d9ad63839ad263b