"parents": ["c6cc1affeeeb576fd8c8a754a68bbea4b925d414"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083626:  gate the optimized jar layout behind an explicit opt-in r=necko-reviewers,valentin\n\nBuildFileList's offset-4 \"optimized jar layout\" shortcut (bug 559961) was\ngated only on XRE_IsParentProcess(), not on whether the file is actually\nour own omni.jar.\n\nAdd aAllowOptimizedLayout to nsZipArchive::OpenArchive, defaulting to\nfalse, and have Omnijar pass true, since it already knows the file is our\nown omni.jar. Every other caller now always uses the standard EOCD-based\nparse.\n\nAlso updates test_corrupt_1801102.js: its fixture happens to have a\nCentral Directory signature at offset 4, so it's now rejected at open()\ninstead of later during test().\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335617\n", "files": ["modules/libjar/nsZipArchive.cpp", "modules/libjar/nsZipArchive.h", "modules/libjar/test/unit/test_corrupt_1801102.js", "xpcom/build/Omnijar.cpp"], "git_node": "bc27b23f58474c6d3714211c3ac59a68b4ff53db", "git_parents": ["a63fb65a6c9421553008f8ba1dc27ae399c20212"], "node": "4dd4f123eeb9637724b341ff852158a4cbbfcd55", "parents": ["6b4f0f952aa0649d8c05db4d778562f0a895dcb4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080133 - Fail program linking for transform feedback varyings with unexpected types. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335714\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/WebGLProgram.cpp"], "git_node": "8c27489c2b0cf46194ef9af029127a9d3c1943e6", "git_parents": ["bc27b23f58474c6d3714211c3ac59a68b4ff53db"], "node": "45e2faa394380fe3ec81493f23d1957b03d90039", "parents": ["4dd4f123eeb9637724b341ff852158a4cbbfcd55"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tooru Fujisawa \u003carai_a@mac.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072077 - Part 1: Use https in the 