": "Bug 2087854 - [loong64] Part 5: Unify delegation of store{8,16,32}(Imm32, Address). r=spidermonkey-reviewers,jandem\n\nstorePtr(ImmWord, ...) is kept untouched, which is consistent with\nRISCV64's current approach.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338571\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64.cpp", "js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64.h"], "git_node": "92a410f49cf7539728637760424d67845e145e42", "git_parents": ["0e2d20f798532c9bf19434a9844e5166b1363aae"], "node": "e028dada5dd87e193ab2f72b076d33ba97999fc5", "parents": ["2a2cd5edfcf0e3c67e37d02d6e188c1c3caaa015"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087854 - [loong64] Part 6: Use already-allocated temp in MacroAssembler::mulDoublePtr. r=spidermonkey-reviewers,jandem\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338572\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64-inl.h"], "git_node": "d628a34d12908fb235bf5fca1bf188bdad68d4fe", "git_parents": ["92a410f49cf7539728637760424d67845e145e42"], "node": "2ac0f9d080c5af89d06bc863cbe2cecd297274c5", "parents": ["e028dada5dd87e193ab2f72b076d33ba97999fc5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087854 - [loong64] Part 7: Implement scratch-free MacroAssembler::mulBy3. r=spidermonkey-reviewers,jandem\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338573\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64-inl.h"], "git_node": "ae83ea2d6e09bc5def2241e02826becc580dbb13", "git_parents": ["d628a34d12908fb235bf5fca1bf188bdad68d4fe"], "node": "71353581275d3d156e5ffb9e9a10788a2d49f75e", "parents": ["2ac0f9d080c5af89d06bc863cbe2cecd297274c5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087854 - [loong64] Part 8: Delegate expansion of immediate multiplication to MASM. r=spidermonkey-reviewers,jandem\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338574\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/loong64/CodeGenerator-loong64.cpp", "js/src/jit/loong64/CodeGenerator-loong64.h", "js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64.cpp"], "git_node": "01a5aeab7a7dda4eb39ac2311acfa4fda2d9f835", "git_parents": ["ae83ea2d6e09bc5def2241e02826becc580dbb13"], "node": "00b439c5f0479737656231ab628ddd848df5861e", "parents": ["71353581275d3d156e5ffb9e9a10788a2d49f75e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087854 - [loong64] Part 9: Use expandable ma_mul_d in ma_mul32TestOverflow(..., Imm32, ...). r=spidermonkey-reviewers,jandem\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338575\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/loong64/CodeGenerator-loong64.cpp", "js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64.cpp"], "git_node": "5911acd3aac2b7c7efb6c89b71e77c148bb76d97", "git_parents": ["01a5aeab7a7dda4eb39ac2311acfa4fda2d9f835"], "node": "8e24ad8f153e9dd5673e0017898a0adab49ce590", "parents": ["00b439c5f0479737656231ab628ddd848df5861e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087854 - [loong64] Part 10: (Drive-by) Add missing #include \"mozilla/Casting.h\" to MacroAssembler-loong64.cpp. r=spidermonkey-reviewers,jandem\n\nThis is pure hygiene, since mozilla:BitwiseCast is currently\ntransitively pulled in.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338576\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64.cpp"], "git_node": "2ec07e22398d3e66ba139a81fcc2de8efc2c4efd", "git_parents": ["5911acd3aac2b7c7efb6c89b71e77c148bb76d97"], "node": "2f38afde114fe6cf4738bf2ddcfe58596f4c8495", "parents": ["8e24ad8f153e9dd5673e0017898a0adab49ce590"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087942 - [loong64] Micro-optimize ma_mul_d and ma_mul. r=spidermonkey-reviewers,jandem\n\nThis unifies both MASM methods with the following optimizations, with\nlatency in cycles and calcuated per [0]:\n\n        RHS             Latency\n        -1              1\n        0               1\n        1               1\n        2               1\n        2^n + 1, n\u003c5    1\n        2^n + 1, n\u003e=5   2\n        2^n             1\n        2^n - 1         2\n        2^n + 2^m, n\u003em  3\n        (otherwise)     \u003e=5\n\n[0]: https://gist.github.com/CSharperMantle/77a830fe312590ec796d92620a5196b4#file-measurement-3b6000-12c24t-txt\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338641\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/binop-divrem-with-constant-loong64-ion-codegen.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/binop-loong64-ion-codegen.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/mul-loong64-ion-codegen.js", "js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64.cpp"], "git_node": "705a6d654db1b15db27b478bd26decbc241b64a7", "git_parents": ["2ec07e22398d3e66ba139a81fcc2de8efc2c4efd"], "node": "167a1e790edf0ddd8d12ecc236d4a2bc2d9d177e", "parents": ["2f38afde114fe6cf4738bf2ddcfe58596f4c8495"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jari Jalkanen \u003cjjalkanen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087151 - Null mGroupInfo on replaced OriginInfo in LockedAddOriginInfo. r=dom-storage-reviewers,hsingh\n\nAlso fix the lookup to compare by origin string instead of pointer,\nconsistent with LockedGetOriginInfo and LockedRemoveOriginInfo.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338088\n", "files": ["dom/quota/GroupInfo.cpp", "dom/quota/GroupInfo.h", "dom/quota/QuotaManager.h", "dom/quota/test/gtest/TestGroupInfo.cpp", "dom/quota/test/gtest/moz.build"], "git_node": "a6d6021dd8ba556084bb6a9e32c29ecae3d92ac6", "git_parents": ["705a6d654db1b15db27b478bd26decbc241b64a7"], "node": "cbb9c8e917372e2b67976187794911bf68c79685", "parents": ["167a1e790edf0ddd8d12ecc236d4a2bc2d9d177e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Calixte Denizet \u003ccalixte.denizet@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076793 - Add a ChromeOnly HTMLCanvasElement.printToPDF drawing straight into a PDF. r=emilio,webidl\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336759\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/test/chrome/chrome.toml", "dom/canvas/test/chrome/test_printToPDF.html", "dom/html/HTMLCanvasElement.cpp", "dom/html/HTMLCanvasElement.h", "dom/webidl/HTMLCanvasElement.webidl"], "git_node": "307686390bfbc933a88001710835dd4bc10acb94", "git_parents": ["a6d6021dd8ba556084bb6a9e32c29ecae3d92ac6"], "node": "e2ff29d9466fa5691420dd050e7528b22701328d", "parents": ["cbb9c8e917372e2b67976187794911bf68c79685"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Calixte Denizet \u003ccalixte.denizet@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076793 - Generate pdf.js field appearances with canvas printToPDF in the viewer's process. r=emilio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336760\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/GeckoViewPdfJsParent.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/PdfJsParent.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/PdfJsPrint.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/PdfStreamConverter.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/test/browser_pdfjs_printtopdf.js"], "git_node": "4bca72a3526f59a632d8080aba43613d51c31257", "git_parents": ["307686390bfbc933a88001710835dd4bc10acb94"], "node": "278a4bad4fe6f8671289e2c50b2af9044e64b9f6", "parents": ["e2ff29d9466fa5691420dd050e7528b22701328d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Zia \u003cfzia@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2078186 - Let the model know which tabs pinned r=ai-security-reviewers,gcardieri\n\nget_open_tabs did not pass if tabs are pinned, so the model could not act on requests that mention pinned tabs specifically.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334148\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/models/Tools.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/xpcshell/test_Tools_GetOpenTabs.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_security_get_open_tabs.js"], "git_node": "e9b5c423dc3e126f3e1bd18a3cfaa0950244c514", "git_parents": ["4bca72a3526f59a632d8080aba43613d51c31257"], "node": "4620aeba98e3fc6be9256be34f682688a686d9f4", "parents": ["278a4bad4fe6f8671289e2c50b2af9044e64b9f6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mike Conley \u003cmconley@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087517 - Allow New Tab widget registry entries to show an icon in their card header. r=nina-py\n\nMozWidgetCard draws an entry's optional icon in the leading slot of its\nmoz-widget-header: 16px, vertically centered on the name, with a 6px gap.\nNo registry entry sets an icon yet.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338384\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/common/WidgetsRegistry.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Widgets/MozWidgetCard.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Widgets/_Widgets.scss", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/Widgets/MozWidgetCard.test.jsx"], "git_node": "d3e2b37067a8bc124ee55887e404cf60c50a5a96", "git_parents": ["e9b5c423dc3e126f3e1bd18a3cfaa0950244c514"], "node": "2c8f941f9f2e7637dfea8c27ff583a28757fb7e3", "parents": ["4620aeba98e3fc6be9256be34f682688a686d9f4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "James Teow \u003cjteow@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086805 - Expand browser_calculate_frecency_speed.js with more scenarios - r=places-reviewers,daisuke,perftest-reviewers,aglavic\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337819\n", "files": ["testing/perfdocs/generated/mozperftest.md", "toolkit/components/places/tests/browser/performance/browser_calculate_frecency_speed.js"], "git_node": "a9e6d629ce4a84e2647ee2ecab31bccd1116ba64", "git_parents": ["d3e2b37067a8bc124ee55887e404cf60c50a5a96"], "node": "58813ac2166fb4fa764554c298754026fbecc871", "parents": ["2c8f941f9f2e7637dfea8c27ff583a28757fb7e3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "kpatenio \u003ckpatenio@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082903 - remove 'browser.nova.enabled=false' coverage from browser_UsageTelemetry_idleDaily.js r=sclements\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337732\n", "files": ["browser/modules/test/browser/browser_UsageTelemetry_idleDaily.js"], "git_node": "4e63d8c0229e74ea3975e6a09ea408c9c50fd489", "git_parents": ["a9e6d629ce4a84e2647ee2ecab31bccd1116ba64"], "node": "1c7513264781172f38557036d07302a22a90a398", "parents": ["58813ac2166fb4fa764554c298754026fbecc871"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Hochheiden \u003cahochheiden@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087186 - Run the ffvpx-symbols linter in CI r=linter-reviewers,sylvestre\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338067\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/source-test/mozlint.yml"], "git_node": "5850cc176714d09e105a2ca86c53752d1671e341", "git_parents": ["4e63d8c0229e74ea3975e6a09ea408c9c50fd489"], "node": "d43025bed5e25565ce2a179edc4ee34956b683dc", "parents": ["1c7513264781172f38557036d07302a22a90a398"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sotaro Ikeda \u003csotaro.ikeda.g@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2085290 - Merge Acquire Fences Instead of Overwriting Them in AndroidHardwareBuffer r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nPreviously, SetAcquireFence() overwrote the existing acquire fence, potentially losing pending GPU synchronization. This patch merges the new fence with the existing one to ensure that all pending operations complete before the buffer is reused.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338661\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/AndroidHardwareBuffer.cpp"], "git_node": "d0741bc6c8a74eef4654294c5d5b0a598965e842", "git_parents": ["5850cc176714d09e105a2ca86c53752d1671e341"], "node": "9af6b884287d0e6ee2af17c70e2adaa08a418236", "parents": ["d43025bed5e25565ce2a179edc4ee34956b683dc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan-Erik Rediger \u003cjrediger@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2088150 - Record profiles.current_missing onto the correct ping r=mossop\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338796\n", "files": ["browser/components/profiles/metrics.yaml"], "git_node": "38e1f0e2c5dc09e11f521566156cbaf80bdd3fdb", "git_parents": ["d0741bc6c8a74eef4654294c5d5b0a598965e842"], "node": "7fc95ab89fd2d01e182b2bbc9e3a6e864969db9a", "parents": ["9af6b884287d0e6ee2af17c70e2adaa08a418236"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alexandre Poirot \u003cpoirot.alex@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1674342 - [DevTools] Enable worker targets by default and stop debugging worker console message from the main thread. r=devtools-reviewers,nchevobbe\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336736\n", "files": ["devtools/client/debugger/test/mochitest/browser_dbg-breaking-from-console.js", "modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml"], "git_node": "99255d704c05a8c741d744ebfb789f95b790aacc", "git_parents": ["38e1f0e2c5dc09e11f521566156cbaf80bdd3fdb"], "node": "c715d8622d46ba3208e8b91dfefb69657dfffe8c", "parents": ["7fc95ab89fd2d01e182b2bbc9e3a6e864969db9a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alexandre Poirot \u003cpoirot.alex@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1603205 - [devtools] Remove windowless-service worker preference. r=devtools-reviewers,fluent-reviewers,bolsson,nchevobbe\n\nAlways consider (service) workers debuggable in the application panel.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337263\n", "files": ["devtools/client/aboutdebugging/src/actions/debug-targets.js", "devtools/client/aboutdebugging/src/actions/runtimes.js", "devtools/client/aboutdebugging/src/components/debugtarget/ServiceWorkerAction.js", "devtools/client/aboutdebugging/src/components/debugtarget/ServiceWorkerAdditionalActions.js", "devtools/client/aboutdebugging/src/modules/client-wrapper.js", "devtools/client/aboutdebugging/src/types/runtime.js", "devtools/client/application/initializer.js", "devtools/client/application/src/actions/workers.js", "devtools/client/application/src/components/service-workers/Registration.js", "devtools/client/application/src/components/service-workers/RegistrationList.js", "devtools/client/application/src/components/service-workers/Worker.js", "devtools/client/application/src/components/service-workers/WorkersPage.js", "devtools/client/application/src/modules/application-services.js", "devtools/client/application/src/reducers/workers-state.js", "devtools/client/application/test/browser/browser.toml", "devtools/client/application/test/browser/browser_application_panel_viewsource-service-worker.js", "devtools/client/application/test/node/components/service-workers/__snapshots__/components_application_panel-Registration.test.js.snap", "devtools/client/application/test/node/components/service-workers/__snapshots__/components_application_panel-RegistrationList.test.js.snap", "devtools/client/application/test/node/components/service-workers/__snapshots__/components_application_panel-WorkersPage.test.js.snap", "devtools/client/application/test/node/components/service-workers/components_application_panel-Registration.test.js", "devtools/client/application/test/node/components/service-workers/components_application_panel-RegistrationList.test.js", "devtools/client/application/test/node/components/service-workers/components_application_panel-Worker.test.js", "devtools/client/application/test/node/components/service-workers/components_application_panel-WorkersPage.test.js", "devtools/client/application/test/xpcshell/test_workers_reducer.js", "devtools/client/debugger/panel.js", "devtools/client/debugger/src/client/firefox.js", "devtools/client/debugger/src/utils/prefs.js", "devtools/client/debugger/test/mochitest/browser_dbg-service-workers-reload.js", "devtools/client/debugger/test/mochitest/browser_dbg-service-workers.js", "devtools/client/debugger/test/mochitest/browser_dbg-windowless-service-workers-reload.js", "devtools/client/debugger/test/mochitest/browser_dbg-windowless-service-workers.js", "devtools/client/debugger/test/mochitest/browser_qz.toml", "devtools/client/locales/en-US/aboutdebugging.ftl", "devtools/server/actors/device.js", "modules/libpref/init/all.js"], "git_node": "6b83159c0b6e3da6a7d579c6b1f5f3814610b250", "git_parents": ["99255d704c05a8c741d744ebfb789f95b790aacc"], "node": "17fe39870571c7c309a65db1961ae30c4ab29040", "parents": ["c715d8622d46ba3208e8b91dfefb69657dfffe8c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alexandre Poirot \u003cpoirot.alex@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1843272 - [devtools] Enable service worker debugging at toolbox startup. r=devtools-reviewers,nchevobbe\n\nThis allows to see service worker messages in the console without having\nto open the debugger.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337264\n", "files": ["devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/_jsterm.toml", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/_webconsole_lz.toml", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/browser_jsterm_evaluation_context_selector.js", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/browser_jsterm_evaluation_context_selector_targets_update.js", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/browser_webconsole_service_worker.js", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/test-console-evaluation-context-selector.html", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/test-service-worker.html", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/test-service-worker.js", "devtools/shared/commands/target/target-command.js"], "git_node": "818bbe64c71dd396ea05ff742d1bee42113f69c2", "git_parents": ["6b83159c0b6e3da6a7d579c6b1f5f3814610b250"], "node": "194bc376dfa0cc1c0963dfeb62bb0bdbf13fa4de", "parents": ["17fe39870571c7c309a65db1961ae30c4ab29040"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Hochheiden \u003cahochheiden@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2085849 - Hash only the changed inputs in `mach_func_cache` r=linter-reviewers,sylvestre\n\nChecking whether the cached toolchain tasks are still valid took about\n4 seconds on Windows on every `bootstrap_toolchain` call, which `mach\nlint` makes for mozcheck. It read and hashed some 6000 files every time,\nand walked `mobile/android` once for each of the three Gradle globs. The\nhash of each file is now kept with its size, modification time and\ninode, so unchanged files are not read again, and the `\u003cdir\u003e/**/\u003cname\u003e`\nglobs that share a directory are expanded in one walk. The check now\ntakes about 1.6 seconds. The cache key changes shape, so existing\nentries miss once.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336628\n", "files": ["python/mach/mach/func_cache.py", "python/mach/mach/test/python.toml", "python/mach/mach/test/test_func_cache.py"], "git_node": "5ac3e10c8b62193464ceb325c29928a3dcdac47a", "git_parents": ["818bbe64c71dd396ea05ff742d1bee42113f69c2"], "node": "2b1b1c79b72a6955379e6f2bd3d8cb9ff00cbf5a", "parents": ["194bc376dfa0cc1c0963dfeb62bb0bdbf13fa4de"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082101 - Refuse off-thread promise task registration after async task shutdown r=yulia,iain\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334345\n", "files": ["js/src/builtin/AtomicsObject.cpp", "js/src/vm/OffThreadPromiseRuntimeState.cpp"], "git_node": "263aa1dbdeafea250549f631dc9363de8457678d", "git_parents": ["5ac3e10c8b62193464ceb325c29928a3dcdac47a"], "node": "81d68c189d34e3d84d170a201ccfc77b82ccf1b5", "parents": ["2b1b1c79b72a6955379e6f2bd3d8cb9ff00cbf5a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082101 - Don't resolve CookieStore and getNotifications() promises in a dying global r=cookie-reviewers,dom-worker-reviewers,valentin,edenchuang\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334346\n", "files": ["dom/cookiestore/CookieStore.cpp", "dom/cookiestore/CookieStoreManager.cpp", "dom/serviceworkers/ServiceWorkerRegistration.cpp"], "git_node": "fc5b3d4a829a97a045c04e38168357df847fe002", "git_parents": ["263aa1dbdeafea250549f631dc9363de8457678d"], "node": "c03c088811ab0e07e3b44a58af6e1f620e771f40", "parents": ["81d68c189d34e3d84d170a201ccfc77b82ccf1b5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2015321 - Hide the fullscreen toolbox when the pointer leaves the window. r=tabbrowser-reviewers,sclements\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335594\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/browser-fullScreenAndPointerLock.js", "browser/base/content/test/browser-fullscreen/browser.toml", "browser/base/content/test/browser-fullscreen/browser_fullscreen_autohide_leave_window.js"], "git_node": "84c3a480c4dcc4199c408eab9eddafd670f0b315", "git_parents": ["fc5b3d4a829a97a045c04e38168357df847fe002"], "node": "031ce3b6ef7c38ed3526e36ab80d7052fd999318", "parents": ["c03c088811ab0e07e3b44a58af6e1f620e771f40"], "tags": []}, {"author": "t-p-white \u003ctowhite@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086039 - Refactor `isFxaPairingLink` check to be scoped to the current FXA server and exact URI path r=corentin,roger\n\nPull request: https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/pull/423\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/IntentReceiverActivity.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/IntentReceiverActivityTest.kt"], "git_node": "390e056826c973bd3ff9bf0c1ebbc16ad6ac5324", "git_parents": ["84c3a480c4dcc4199c408eab9eddafd670f0b315"], "node": "103b0b910b32251887960e0517528a199eaa10ba", "parents": ["031ce3b6ef7c38ed3526e36ab80d7052fd999318"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "d