branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082393 - part 1 - New CustomizableMenuStore r=android-reviewers,giorga,android-build-system-reviewers\n\nThis ensures a cleaner separation between the state and actions of\nMenuStore and what we need for the customization screen, eg: what\nmenu sections to show as hidden and support for informing when the\nmenu structure has changed.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337951\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/build.gradle", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/CustomizeMenuFragment.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/data/MenuItemsGroup.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/store/CustomizableMenuAction.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/store/CustomizableMenuState.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/store/CustomizableMenuStore.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/store/MenuEvent.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenu.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuGridGroupContent.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuGroupContent.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuRowGroupContent.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuScreen.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/test/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/store/CustomizableMenuStoreTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuBuilder.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuConfigurations.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuSectionConfiguration.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/compose/customize/CustomizeMenuFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/compose/customize/FenixCustomizeMenuFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/CustomizationFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/navigation/nav_graph.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuConfigurationsTest.kt"], "git_node": "e38bbf61519c6e5fd928458f78f56e94575d64c0", "git_parents": ["b9b8c4476f1e3dade4151052c31be0ee47bc6a73"], "node": "c9c709a41334645271ecfddbe5055a634f293d0b", "parents": ["4c4fc9aabc36262512ddebea88de27358f4ea7bd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082393 - part 2 - New proto datastore for the browser menu customization data r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337952\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/datastore/CustomizedMenuRecordSerializer.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/datastore/DataStores.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/proto/browser_menu_customization.proto", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/datastore/CustomizedMenuRecordSerializerTest.kt"], "git_node": "41e2655fe6d18e615ef81235bf492b352bdd73a3", "git_parents": ["e38bbf61519c6e5fd928458f78f56e94575d64c0"], "node": "6cd9d68a8013b73b85bdc5161beb1f32119038ee", "parents": ["c9c709a41334645271ecfddbe5055a634f293d0b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082393 - part 3 - Build the browser menu from the user's customization data r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nMenuConfigurations.browser can now order the menu sections as chosen by\nthe user, and there is a default structure with support for sections\nwhich start hidden.\nCustomizedMenuInfo.reconciledWith adapts a stored customization to the\nsections available in the app: it drops unknown sections, keeps the\nrequired ones visible, and adds sections new in this app version as shown\nor hidden as in the default.\n\nAlso moves the mapping of a menu section to a MenuItemsGroup to\nMenuSectionConfiguration so it can be reused outside of MenuBuilder.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337953\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuRowGroupContent.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/CustomizedMenuInfo.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuBuilder.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuConfigurations.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuSectionConfiguration.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/CustomizedMenuInfoTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuConfigurationsTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuSectionConfigurationTest.kt"], "git_node": "9f149111cde3327abca86b54e3888f0ddeffd13c", "git_parents": ["41e2655fe6d18e615ef81235bf492b352bdd73a3"], "node": "726f72c263a82271d4fc389fcdf2b082835ff7a1", "parents": ["6cd9d68a8013b73b85bdc5161beb1f32119038ee"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082393 - part 4 - Move the menu configurations to a new configuration package r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nSplits MenuConfigurations into BrowserMenuConfiguration, HomeMenuConfiguration\nand CustomTabMenuConfiguration, each owning its own section ids, and moves\nthem, together with MenuSectionConfiguration and FenixMenuItem, to a new\ncomponents.menu.configuration package.\nOnly the browser menu supports customization, so this keeps that logic\nseparate from the other menus.\n\nNo behavior changes.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337954\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuBuilder.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuConfigurations.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuItemProvidersFactory.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuItemsRegistry.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuSectionConfiguration.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/configuration/BrowserMenuConfiguration.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/configuration/CustomTabMenuConfiguration.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/configuration/FenixMenuItem.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/configuration/HomeMenuConfiguration.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/configuration/MenuSectionConfiguration.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/proto/browser_menu_customization.proto", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuBuilderTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuConfigurationsTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuItemEventRouterTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuItemProvidersFactoryTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuItemsRegistryTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuSectionConfigurationTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/configuration/BrowserMenuConfigurationTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/configuration/CustomTabMenuConfigurationTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/configuration/HomeMenuConfigurationTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/configuration/MenuSectionConfigurationTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/MenuMiddlewareTest.kt"], "git_node": "67a84c5b428862a79e62b67012ed004efaf85005", "git_parents": ["9f149111cde3327abca86b54e3888f0ddeffd13c"], "node": "ea10f180696e762a0fc2f37ca39555458d879cbb", "parents": ["726f72c263a82271d4fc389fcdf2b082835ff7a1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082393 - part 5 - Persist the browser menu customization made in the customize menu screen r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nAdd MenuCustomizationRepository, which reads and saves the user's browser\nmenu customization through the proto DataStore. Stored data is reconciled\nwith the sections currently available in the app every time it is read,\nand only written back when the user changes the menu.\n\nThe browser menu is built from the stored customization, falling back to\nthe default structure while it is not read yet. The customize menu screen\nshows the current structure and saves every change through the new\nCustomizeMenuMiddleware, which also tells the screen whether the menu\ndiffers from the default one.\n\nThe customization is read ahead of the menu being opened after visual\ncompleteness, or when the customize menu screen is enabled in secret\nsettings.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337955\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/FenixApplication.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/Components.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuCustomizationRepository.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/configuration/BrowserMenuConfiguration.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/CustomizeMenuMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/settings/SecretSettingsFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuCustomizationRepositoryTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/CustomizeMenuMiddlewareTest.kt"], "git_node": "5892c8dc785568e232aa03e33dd8a76e63cff872", "git_parents": ["67a84c5b428862a79e62b67012ed004efaf85005"], "node": "d266905364e7da3f64f22fecd0b719bc329b0ed7", "parents": ["ea10f180696e762a0fc2f37ca39555458d879cbb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082393 - part 6 - Show the browser menu sections in the customize menu screen r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nCustomizeMenuMiddleware now fills the customize menu screen with the\nactual items of every browser menu section, built by a MenuBuilder over\nBrowserMenuConfiguration.allSections() so that sections the user hid are\nalso available.\nSections are shown in the user's order, with support for mandatory\nsections and also hidden ones.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337956\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuScreen.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/compose/customize/CustomizeMenuFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/configuration/BrowserMenuConfiguration.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/CustomizeMenuMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/configuration/BrowserMenuConfigurationTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/CustomizeMenuMiddlewareTest.kt"], "git_node": "9830219c98d9b15c6d6da90580950d5b305cc07f", "git_parents": ["5892c8dc785568e232aa03e33dd8a76e63cff872"], "node": "a67486a9d738d7d6274c690b39ea37a3b364e063", "parents": ["d266905364e7da3f64f22fecd0b719bc329b0ed7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082393 - part 7 - Ensure the \"Sign in\" menu item does not show a summary in the \"Customize menu\" screen r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nRemoved the hardcoded summary from the default menu item configuration\nreturned by MozillaAccountMenuItemProvider.\nWhen this menu item is shown in the menu the right summary will be\nadded dynamically based on the current account status.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337957\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/accounts/MozillaAccountMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/accounts/MozillaAccountMenuItemProviderTest.kt"], "git_node": "9cf23f09ce461adbf644ea51878e11a3ad6d843a", "git_parents": ["9830219c98d9b15c6d6da90580950d5b305cc07f"], "node": "80520123d80f331656e37e719d28c0711df5220d", "parents": ["a67486a9d738d7d6274c690b39ea37a3b364e063"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082393 - part 8 - Small updates to the items layout in the Customize menu screen r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nRemove the interactions support for items shown in this screen.\nReuse the shape, semantics and content helpers of the shared menu\ncomposables instead of keeping private copies, and drop the unused\nbackgroundColor parameters.\nMerge the row and grid group content into CustomizeMenuGroupContent,\ndriven by a CustomizeMenuGroupState instead of two booleans.\nShow only the first three items of a section, the last one only partly\n(4/7 of its height, as in the design) and fading out, instead of using a\nfixed height. This also keeps the other items out of TalkBack.\nShow mandatory sections like the other shown ones and use dividers, with\nside padding, only in hidden sections.\nShow the \"Drag sections to reorder\" text as a marquee when it does not\nfit next to the preview button.\nKeep a bottom margin under the hidden sections placeholder.\nKey the sections by id and remember the derived lists.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337958\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuGridContainer.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuGridItem.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuGridItemCommon.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuListItem.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuListItemCommon.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuListItemGroup.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenu.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuDragIndicator.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuGridContainer.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuGridGroupContent.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuGridItem.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuGroupContent.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuGroupState.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuListItem.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuListItemGroup.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuRowGroupContent.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/customize/CustomizeMenuScreen.kt"], "git_node": "382980a420ae8002e6fddfc323fd516c0c492056", "git_parents": ["9cf23f09ce461adbf644ea51878e11a3ad6d843a"], "node": "cd24f566d0918451e7fc554b0b12a2624f910472", "parents": ["80520123d80f331656e37e719d28c0711df5220d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Wyatt Verchere \u003cwverchere@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2085173 - Replace requestSpocAds with requestSpocOrImageAds. r=mconley,jonesetc\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336302\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/lib/AdsClient.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/lib/DiscoveryStreamFeed.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/DiscoveryStreamFeed.test.js"], "git_node": "2da42d0aa7f0bb7cd77742e84d89f7578bd2dd20", "git_parents": ["382980a420ae8002e6fddfc323fd516c0c492056"], "node": "464a37e16441ea1765773efed18e613d0b0b865e", "parents": ["cd24f566d0918451e7fc554b0b12a2624f910472"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kershaw Chang \u003ckershaw@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053088 - Establish the outer proxy connection via Happy Eyeballs, r=mxinden\n\nGated by network.http.happy_eyeballs.proxy_enabled (default off). When enabled,\nthe outer Firefox\u003c-\u003eproxy connection for HTTPS CONNECT and MASQUE proxies is\ndriven by HappyEyeballsConnectionAttempt instead of DnsAndConnectSocket.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311264\n", "files": ["modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml", "netwerk/protocol/http/ConnectionEstablisher.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/HappyEyeballsConnMgrDelegate.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/HappyEyeballsConnectionAttempt.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/HappyEyeballsConnectionAttempt.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/HappyEyeballsTransaction.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/HappyEyeballsTransaction.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/Http3Session.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpBaseChannel.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpConnectionBase.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpConnectionUDP.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsAHttpTransaction.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpChannel.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpConnection.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpConnectionInfo.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpConnectionMgr.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpConnectionMgr.h", "netwerk/test/gtest/TestHappyEyeballsConnectionAttempt.cpp", "netwerk/test/unit/test_http3_proxy.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_http3_proxy_no_speculative.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_https_proxy_h3_outer_via_https_rr.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_https_proxy_with_https_rr.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_proxy_forwarding_peer_port.js", "netwerk/test/unit/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "b95879ca6b82875c6a357d3980dd7d89ee83bf25", "git_parents": ["2da42d0aa7f0bb7cd77742e84d89f7578bd2dd20"], "node": "e6dd02765dcb02c1d9a42311095ccda194be9656", "parents": ["464a37e16441ea1765773efed18e613d0b0b865e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kershaw Chang \u003ckershaw@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053088 - Use Happy Eyeballs for SOCKS proxies via by-name connection attempts, r=necko-reviewers,valentin,mxinden\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324051\n", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/AlternateServices.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/AlternateServices.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/ConnectionEstablisher.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/ConnectionEstablisher.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/HappyEyeballsConnectionAttempt.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/HappyEyeballsConnectionAttempt.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/happy_eyeballs_glue/HappyEyeballs.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/happy_eyeballs_glue/HappyEyeballs.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/happy_eyeballs_glue/src/lib.rs", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsAHttpTransaction.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpChannel.cpp", "netwerk/test/gtest/TestHappyEyeballsConnectionAttempt.cpp", "netwerk/test/gtest/TestHappyEyeballsNetAddrArray.cpp", "netwerk/test/unit/test_altsvc_proxy_cert_origin.js", "netwe