Widget\n- Show the SportsWidgetErrorCard in place of the match body when a live match fails to update\n\nFigma: https://www.figma.com/design/kDvQ8Hd2c5MwN9S3Y2FZ5r/Wrexham-Ideas?node-id=751-150901&m=dev\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338623\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/sports/SportCardData.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/sports/ui/MatchCard.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/sports/ui/SportsWidgetErrorCard.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml"], "git_node": "fda803cb628968e4154db4db8204232ccd73943a", "git_parents": ["a2f4658c3aaf38069f0890552807b4b0a37fffe4"], "node": "b425ac7b327fcdcbd7cd28672eb6141c866e9525", "parents": ["64fb21435ada8751ff8691eaa901dee3f7aa410e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084809 - Part 9: Restore the SportsCardPager with the widget header and page indicator r=android-reviewers,skhan\n\n- Restore SportsCardPager from the removed Homepage Sports Widget with the header above the swipeable pages\n- Add the SportsCardType and SportsCardImpressionSource used by the pager\n\nFigma:\n- Live: https://www.figma.com/design/kDvQ8Hd2c5MwN9S3Y2FZ5r/Wrexham-Ideas?node-id=751-151478&m=dev\n- Error: https://www.figma.com/design/kDvQ8Hd2c5MwN9S3Y2FZ5r/Wrexham-Ideas?node-id=751-150901&m=dev\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338624\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/sports/SportCardData.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/sports/ui/SportsCardPager.kt"], "git_node": "451050187a1f46139ce2db13ce87becd8c1fb1f3", "git_parents": ["fda803cb628968e4154db4db8204232ccd73943a"], "node": "e377b55d01f0513c05123d443718b530693d77af", "parents": ["b425ac7b327fcdcbd7cd28672eb6141c866e9525"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2084809 - Part 10: Restore the remaining team and match status data from the Homepage Sports Widget r=android-reviewers,skhan\n\n- Restore the team identifier, icon URL, elimination state and TeamStanding record\n- Restore the isLive and isPast match status helpers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338625\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/sports/SportCardData.kt"], "git_node": "ba37a63da9208b091351dc7250dae66433898c8d", "git_parents": ["451050187a1f46139ce2db13ce87becd8c1fb1f3"], "node": "4432a34da0706a86bf57591f6bbaf4dd90755bc7", "parents": ["e377b55d01f0513c05123d443718b530693d77af"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Francesco Lodolo \u003cflod@lodolo.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087746 - Migrate Web App Manifest warnings from dom.properties to Fluent. r=dom-core-reviewers,fluent-reviewers,jjaschke,bolsson\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338507\n", "files": ["dom/locales/en-US/chrome/dom/dom.properties", "dom/locales/en-US/dom/manifest.ftl", "dom/manifest/ImageObjectProcessor.sys.mjs", "dom/manifest/ManifestProcessor.sys.mjs", "dom/manifest/ValueExtractor.sys.mjs", "dom/manifest/test/test_ManifestProcessor_warnings.html", "python/l10n/fluent_migrations/bug_2087746_dom_manifest_fluent.py"], "git_node": "9b6f71b6568cc08bc217d605745a8721b92ee84b", "git_parents": ["ba37a63da9208b091351dc7250dae66433898c8d"], "node": "4efc32badf2e9c84cab44f5e61b85c67729cb9ff", "parents": ["4432a34da0706a86bf57591f6bbaf4dd90755bc7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074227 - Part 3: Serve the default top sites from the provider r=android-reviewers,npoon\n\n- The default top sites now backfill the slots that are left over once the pinned and frecent top sites have been added, so they yield to the sites the user actually visits.\n- Google is the only remaining entry in default_pinned_shortcuts.json and keeps its existing path, so it stays an entry in the pinned sites storage.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328603\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/Core.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/raw/default_pinned_shortcuts.json"], "git_node": "db0c965981c02f5f6f442211c471c474c73b82f7", "git_parents": ["9b6f71b6568cc08bc217d605745a8721b92ee84b"], "node": "f2968580a62670a5704ec7ee086a9f6bdc440cf9", "parents": ["4efc32badf2e9c84cab44f5e61b85c67729cb9ff"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074227 - Part 4: Migrate the removed default pinned top sites to the homescreen blocklist r=android-reviewers,npoon\n\n- The absence of a default pinned top site in the pinned sites storage used to be the only record that the user had removed it. Now that they are served by the default top sites provider they would reappear, so that record is carried over to the homescreen blocklist.\n- The migration is skipped on a fresh install, where the default pinned top sites have only just been added and there are no removals to carry over.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328604\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/HomeActivity.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/Components.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/Core.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/DefaultPinnedSitesBinding.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/utils/Settings.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values/preference_keys.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/DefaultPinnedSitesBindingTest.kt"], "git_node": "5178b855d765e3f7a9347d10f7374f54891a198f", "git_parents": ["db0c965981c02f5f6f442211c471c474c73b82f7"], "node": "952ef76fc38cb06860fb61cacb4efe9c5a8a7744", "parents": ["f2968580a62670a5704ec7ee086a9f6bdc440cf9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075027 - Add TopSite.DefaultPinned for the default top sites held in the pinned sites storage r=android-reviewers,npoon\n\n- The default top sites seeded into the pinned sites storage, such as Google, are now TopSite.DefaultPinned, leaving TopSite.Default for the ones served by the default top sites provider.\n- Only the top sites held in the pinned sites storage show the pin badge, matching Desktop.\n- The long_press telemetry reports DEFAULT_PINNED for them.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328679\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/top-sites/src/androidTest/java/mozilla/components/feature/top/sites/OnDevicePinnedSitesStorageTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/top-sites/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/top/sites/DefaultTopSitesStorage.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/top-sites/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/top/sites/TopSite.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/top-sites/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/top/sites/db/PinnedSiteEntity.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/top-sites/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/top/sites/DefaultTopSitesStorageTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/top-sites/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/top/sites/PinnedSitesStorageTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/top-sites/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/top/sites/TopSitesUseCasesTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/metrics.yaml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/MenuDialogMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ext/TopSite.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/ShortcutMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/TopSites.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/controller/TopSiteController.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ext/TopSiteTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/blocklist/BlocklistMiddlewareTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/DefaultPinnedSitesBindingTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/controller/DefaultTopSiteControllerTest.kt"], "git_node": "e9509748b81aecc47bb72c5c87fa2f4438510404", "git_parents": ["5178b855d765e3f7a9347d10f7374f54891a198f"], "node": "30c0e17988f2021fe929ae25379e76aa0a13ca8a", "parents": ["952ef76fc38cb06860fb61cacb4efe9c5a8a7744"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074227 - Part 5: Pin an edited default top site and unblock pinned shortcuts r=android-reviewers,npoon\n\n- Editing a default top site served by the provider adds it as a pinned site, as is done for a frecent top site.\n- Pinning a shortcut removes its URL from the homescreen blocklist so that it can be shown again, matching Desktop.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329619\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/appstate/AppAction.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/appstate/ShortcutStateReducer.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/MenuDialogMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/blocklist/BlocklistHandler.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/blocklist/BlocklistMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/ShortcutMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/controller/TopSiteController.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/middleware/ShortcutsMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/appstate/ShortcutStateReducerTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuDialogMiddlewareTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/blocklist/BlocklistHandlerTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/blocklist/BlocklistMiddlewareTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/middleware/HomeTelemetryMiddlewareTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/ShortcutMenuItemProviderTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/controller/DefaultTopSiteControllerTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/snackbar/SnackbarBindingTest.kt"], "git_node": "6e066095cbbc6001f56a58816fe44952fe6cdf86", "git_parents": ["e9509748b81aecc47bb72c5c87fa2f4438510404"], "node": "8b74eeef401d9175b257fb3ca3ebfb98486b84e3", "parents": ["30c0e17988f2021fe929ae25379e76aa0a13ca8a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075030 - Remove the shortcut limit when adding a shortcut from the menu r=android-reviewers,android-l10n-reviewers,parker,skhan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328740\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuDialogFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuItemProvidersFactory.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/compose/customize/CustomizeMenuFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/MenuDialogMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/ShortcutMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuDialogMiddlewareTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuItemProvidersFactoryTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/ShortcutMenuItemProviderTest.kt"], "git_node": "7fec0c96fe3e909db8e0238a810adab7297b8572", "git_parents": ["6e066095cbbc6001f56a58816fe44952fe6cdf86"], "node": "80471a89d9ddec511ec0f36e2f034e049de22da5", "parents": ["8b74eeef401d9175b257fb3ca3ebfb98486b84e3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075033 - Include all the pinned sites in the top sites r=android-reviewers,skhan\n\n- DefaultTopSitesStorage.getTopSites returns all the pinned sites instead of only the first `totalSites`, so every pinned site can be shown on the homepage when expanded and on the Shortcuts screen. The provided, frecent and default top sites still only fill the slots left within that number.\n- Renamed `totalSites` to `targetSitesCount` in TopSitesConfig and TopSitesStorage.getTopSites, since it is now the number of top sites to fill up to rather than a limit.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329784\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/top-sites/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/top/sites/DefaultTopSitesStorage.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/top-sites/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/top/sites/TopSitesConfig.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/top-sites/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/top/sites/TopSitesStorage.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/top-sites/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/top/sites/presenter/DefaultTopSitesPresenter.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/top-sites/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/top/sites/DefaultTopSitesStorageTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/docs/changelog.md", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/FenixApplication.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/TopSitesConfigCreator.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/TopSitesConfigCreatorTest.kt", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/focus/biometrics/LockObserver.kt", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/focus/fragment/BrowserFragment.kt", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/focus/fragment/UrlInputFragment.kt", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/focus/telemetry/GleanMetricsService.kt", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/focus/topsites/DefaultTopSitesStorage.kt", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/focus/topsites/DefaultTopSitesStorageTest.kt"], "git_node": "7cdcef1dd09808630cbaa87b3ec35eb6a6ae5ecf", "git_parents": ["7fec0c96fe3e909db8e0238a810adab7297b8572"], "node": "9ed14c1de61302d2904cfb723a80fa22a474fc68", "parents": ["80471a89d9ddec511ec0f36e2f034e049de22da5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076552 - Use getTopSitesConfig for the top sites warm-up in FenixApplication r=android-reviewers,npoon\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329952\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/FenixApplication.kt"], "git_node": "b685b4614069b6ecfa75ad2c59e7ac677aa7f02b", "git_parents": ["7cdcef1dd09808630cbaa87b3ec35eb6a6ae5ecf"], "node": "13000eb422c9d6b9081ca7632346da5857012e73", "parents": ["9ed14c1de61302d2904cfb723a80fa22a474fc68"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074227 - Part 6: Update the top sites when the region changes r=android-reviewers,skhan\n\n- The default top sites depend on the region, which is often only detected after the top sites are first shown, so TopSitesBinding now also refreshes them when the current region changes.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330574\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/TopSitesBinding.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/TopSitesBindingTest.kt"], "git_node": "5dcde997823b0d534f263c79b9ec8965c1531d68", "git_parents": ["b685b4614069b6ecfa75ad2c59e7ac677aa7f02b"], "node": "ff4e6d4fd33963db33f331c0b9d944a4015fa6d8", "parents": ["13000eb422c9d6b9081ca7632346da5857012e73"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2077993 - Add regional default shortcuts r=android-reviewers,npoon\n\n- Add default shortcuts for DE, US, IN, FR, BR, GB, PL, IT and ES, replace the JP default shortcuts and stop showing Wikipedia in those regions.\n- The regional default shortcuts are included in the `regional-default-shortcuts` experiment, controlled by a Nimbus feature that is enabled by default. Outside of the experiment, the default shortcuts are unchanged.\n- The default top sites are now filtered by their `include_experiments` and `exclude_experiments`.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330998\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/nimbus.fml.yaml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/Core.kt", "mob