ber@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1765322 - Add AntiTrackingUtils::IsThirdPartyTrackingChannel. r=manuel\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331611\n", "files": ["dom/base/nsContentUtils.cpp", "toolkit/components/antitracking/AntiTrackingUtils.cpp", "toolkit/components/antitracking/AntiTrackingUtils.h", "toolkit/components/antitracking/StorageAccess.cpp"], "git_node": "307d4e5cf4b78c3fc82d868a7afcdd876d4b101c", "git_parents": ["0f581f8c301389f76d8bccc9be0c71696ba94ad2"], "node": "8c237203fa14dc42b1ac19ebc0511c28b7ed8d52", "parents": ["cc6a3bfbb960b9aa9f60d4d167383d3ac0dd7028"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Martin Raiber \u003cmraiber@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1765322 - Use any social tracking classification flag for social tracker cookie states. r=manuel\n\nThe storage access checks and the loaded cookie notification only looked at\nthe generic CLASSIFIED_SOCIALTRACKING flag. Use\nIsThirdPartySocialTrackingResource like the cookie service does.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331612\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/antitracking/AntiTrackingUtils.cpp", "toolkit/components/antitracking/AntiTrackingUtils.h", "toolkit/components/antitracking/ContentBlockingNotifier.cpp", "toolkit/components/antitracking/StorageAccess.cpp"], "git_node": "e1e84da2b5910ea986141d51fa294485256fb99e", "git_parents": ["307d4e5cf4b78c3fc82d868a7afcdd876d4b101c"], "node": "14ab765a922eab5f04269880e6fe2f464fe92c63", "parents": ["8c237203fa14dc42b1ac19ebc0511c28b7ed8d52"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Martin Raiber \u003cmraiber@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1765322 - Add AntiTrackingUtils::IsFirstPartyTrackingChannel. r=manuel\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331613\n", "files": ["dom/base/nsContentUtils.cpp", "toolkit/components/antitracking/AntiTrackingUtils.cpp", "toolkit/components/antitracking/AntiTrackingUtils.h", "toolki