8343 - Update android nightly application-services version bump to 1a1bf67d77340772a3b454a0d3fd7636f50b8b1d r=release-managers,dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D339038\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/plugins/dependencies/src/main/java/ApplicationServices.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/plugins/dependencies/src/main/java/moz.yaml"], "git_node": "48b85c73addccef5b53291edce11b0b3c12164c0", "git_parents": ["aa23f09e9910c0fc9317cd0fc2b634e099dc8c22"], "node": "af6cd45354a91f38c58ecc99326adcfc8c14bf1d", "parents": ["67bee4a76b20a658450236960b6513b22c330e9d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Martin Stransky \u003cstransky@redhat.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087060 [Wayland] Move Gtk specific parts of nsWindowWayland to nsWindowWaylandGtk r=emilio,gtk-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338041\n", "files": ["widget/gtk/WaylandBuffer.h", "widget/gtk/moz.build", "widget/gtk/nsWindow.cpp", "widget/gtk/nsWindow.h", "widget/gtk/nsWindowWayland.cpp", "widget/gtk/nsWindowWayland.h", "widget/gtk/nsWindowWaylandGtk.cpp", "widget/gtk/nsWindowWaylandGtk.h"], "git_node": "7a5d56722e2a9dfdc5594ea501f3dd3d9e132a1a", "git_parents": ["48b85c73addccef5b53291edce11b0b3c12164c0"], "node": "40bf83b0449661eba0efe37b64905dc345823e7f", "parents": ["af6cd45354a91f38c58ecc99326adcfc8c14bf1d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Qu\u00e8ze \u003cflorian@queze.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087113 - Don't keep the window alive while estimating the audio round trip latency, r=media-playback-reviewers,padenot.\n\nnsDOMWindowUtils::DefaultDevicesRoundTripLatency held a manual reference to\nits Promise until the background measurement finished, which takes at least\n2 seconds and longer when the audio device is slow to open. Closing\nabout:support before then kept its window alive. Track the request with a\nDOMMozPromiseRequestHolder so the Promise is dropped when the window goes away.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338036\n", "files": ["dom/base/nsDOMWindowUtils.cpp"], "git_node": "e36c13f209593ddb08623803708dd753238f237e", "git_parents": ["7a5d56722e2a9dfdc5594ea501f3dd3d9e132a1a"], "node": "f4a6dc488b686b7f1c3370d93e3c020a5e38a57e", "parents": ["40bf83b0449661eba0efe37b64905dc345823e7f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sandor Molnar \u003csmolnar@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 1843272 - [devtools] Enable service worker debugging at toolbox startup. r=devtools-reviewers,nchevobbe\" for causing multiple failures\n\nThis reverts commit e38e77936a17e8d8e8c0a0a1cc5074c0ef0bbf96.\n", "files": ["devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/_jsterm.toml", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/_webconsole_lz.toml", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/browser_jsterm_evaluation_context_selector.js", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/browser_jsterm_evaluation_context_selector_targets_update.js", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/browser_webconsole_service_worker.js", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/test-console-evaluation-context-selector.html", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/test-service-worker.html", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/test-service-worker.js", "devtools/shared/commands/target/target-command.js"], "git_node": "f426a39cad5014f627fadcf619ad57551d00dddc", "git_parents": ["e36c13f209593ddb08623803708dd753238f237e"], "node": "dca562acd4b758f5c89e31b324a10faaa7f38eee", "parents": ["f4a6dc488b686b7f1c3370d93e3c020a5e38a57e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sandor Molnar \u003csmolnar@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 1603205 - [devtools] Remove windowless-service worker preference. r=devtools-reviewers,fluent-reviewers,bolsson,nchevobbe\" for causing multiple failures\n\nThis reverts commit ed64659aea12c28eb1878e23594005fd6db0026e.\n", "files": ["devtools/client/aboutdebugging/src/actions/debug-targets.js",