 "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/column-single-lane-fragmentation-007.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/column-single-lane-fragmentation-008.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/row-single-lane-fragmentation-007.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/row-single-lane-fragmentation-008.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/row-single-lane-fragmentation-009.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/row-single-lane-fragmentation-010.html"], "git_node": "06b6faa4fec9bbe1e99461b82a3ffe2e78abbfa8", "git_parents": ["e01c32d7b986a56778dbd12a783c5cff4b0dd826"], "node": "02fca0ae3c6a3d050934e67e3ba601b079692d3a", "parents": ["fa13b3a0e57b6d69549ce6ca1f6b8c6c552179e2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082722 [wpt PR 63687] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 63687\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/column-single-lane-fragmentation-007.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/column-single-lane-fragmentation-008.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/row-single-lane-fragmentation-007.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/row-single-lane-fragmentation-008.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/row-single-lane-fragmentation-009.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/row-single-lane-fragmentation-010.html.ini"], "git_node": "8cb67b58a6ba0d97eeac21de383ffe878f1617fd", "git_parents": ["06b6faa4fec9bbe1e99461b82a3ffe2e78abbfa8"], "node": "fc59a8c2110e48a05bba9cb69a7a6daf84959e41", "parents": ["02fca0ae3c6a3d050934e67e3ba601b079692d3a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jer Noble \u003cjer.noble@apple.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082838 [wpt PR 63743] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=327284, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebVTT WPT ref files should apply font on block level element, not the inline element to match spec (#63743)\n\nThis patch moves font-family:sans-serif from the inline element to the block element\nfor WebVTT WPT ref files. The spec states that the font should be applied on the block\nelement, and this can have implications on the computed line height and positioning of\nthe cue. This change matches an earlier commit: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/54338.\nThat commit only affected tests that use the Ahem font, while this patch expands the change\nto tests that use sans-serif.\n\nWebKit-Bug: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=327284\nWebKit-Canonical-Link: https://commits.webkit.org/323648@main\n\nCo-authored-by: Dana Estra \u003cdestra@apple.com\u003e\n--\n\nwpt-commits: a66675e12459125e68fefab00efc7b81d6d29210\nwpt-pr: 63743\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/rendering/cues-with-video/processing-model/bidi/bidi_ruby-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/rendering/cues-with-video/processing-model/bidi/u002E_u2028_u05D0-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/rendering/cues-with-video/processing-model/bidi/u002E_u2029_u05D0-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/rendering/cues-with-video/processing-model/bidi/u0041_first-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/rendering/cues-with-video/processing-model/bidi/u05D0_first-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/rendering/cues-with-video/processing-model/bidi/u0628_first-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/rendering/cues-with-video/processing-model/bidi/vertical_lr-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/rendering/cues-with-video/processing-model/bidi/vertical_rl-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webvtt/rendering/cues-with-video/processing-model/portrait-ref.tentative.html", "testing/we